<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Mako</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muzimbu Uacili uasonekele Mako</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mako</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muzimbu Uacili uasonekele</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAKO</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Muzimbu Uacili uasonekele Mako uapua umo ua mikanda iuana mu Litavasano Lialiha ije ihandeka vuyoye vua Yesu Kilistu. Umo na umo ua mikanda eyi va utumbula nguavo “Muzimbu,” kulumbununa nguavo “Muzimbu Uacili.” Eyi mikanda va isonekele hanima ya kutsa ca Yesu kuli Mateu, na Mako, na Luka, na Yiuano. Muzimbu Uacili uasonekele Mako ukeuo uapua uauihi cikuma ku mikanda eyi iuana ya Mizimbu yacili. Kaha naua vacitsiliela ngeci ukeuo uakulivanga kukusoneka ku Mizimbu yoshe yacili mukati ka vintsimbu viakupua miaka makumi atanu na limo na miaka itanu (65) na mukati ka miaka makumi atanu na avali (70) hanima ya kusemuka ca Kilistu. Vaka kulilongesa vavengi vatsiliela ngeci ou mukanda va usonekelele mu nganda ya Loma hamulonga uakukolesa vaka Kilistu vamu Loma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mako uje ivatumbula naua nguavo Yiuano Mako, uapuile umo ua cizango kuli kanganda Paulu, na Mbanambase vuno honi katumamesi kendi kapuile kakapi omo uecelele vungenzi vuavo vuakutuala Muzimbu ua vuka Kilistu (Vilinga 13:13) Hakukotokela Mako naua uayile na Mbanambase (Vilinga 15:37-39) Mako naua vamuzivukile kupua kavusamba uakama cikuma ua Petulu (1 Petulu 5:13) Cipue vene Mako kavikundama cikuma via vukaleho vua vuyoye vua Yesu Kilistu, vaka kulilongesa vatsiliela ngeci Mako ikeye uasonekele cikuma via vukaleho vua Petulu eci cikeco cakama mu mukanda ua Muzimbu Uacili ua Mako. Mu Muzimbu Uacili ou, Mako ikeye atala cikuma ha vundongisi na ha vilongesa via Yesu via mamanusuilo a mavu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mako aputuka kuhandeka ha livulu eli mu kapetulu (1: 1-13)</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ambahoni Mako ahandeka ha vipangi via Yesu tele ali mu Ngalileya mu kapetulu (1:14; 8:21)</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Cakuhatako ahandeka via vungenzi vua Yesu vuakuya ku Yelusalema (8:22; 10:52)</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Mako amanusula mukusoneka ha ntsimbu ije Yesu uakele mu Yelusalema, hamo na kutsa cendi na kusanguka cendi (11:1; 16:8)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Kuambulula ca Yiuano muka kumbuitika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateu 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yiuano 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Kuputuka kua Muzimbu Uacili ua Yesu Kilistu, Muna Njambi.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Ngue mu muje vacisoneka kuli kananguizi Isaya nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Taleni, ‘Njikatuma kanganda kange kulutue luove,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">uje akavuahesa ngila yove.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />‘Lizi liaumo ali nakutambeka mu mpambo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">vuaheseni ngila ya Muene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">sungameseni ngila yendi!’”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Kaha Yiuano muka kumbuitika uasholokele mu mpambo, uambuluile kumbuitika ca kutenguluka ca kukonekela ku vupi. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Kaha vantu voshe vayile kuli ikeye, vaje vahumine mu cifuti ca Yundeya, na vantu voshe va mu Yelusalema, valitavelele vipi viavo kaha vavambuitikile kuli ikeye mu Ndonga ya Yundau.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Kaha Yiuano uazalele vuzalo vua kupanga ha maka a kamelu, na muiva ua cilambu mu mbunda yendi, naua uakele nakulia vambimba na vuci. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Kaha uambuluile nguendi, “Munima yange muli nakuija uje ali na nzili kupulakana yange, cipue miva ya vinkaku viendi kunjasa kukotama na kuizitula. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Njamimbuitika na mema, vuno honi ikeye akamimbuitika na Cimbembesi Cakulela.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumbuitika na vieseko via Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13">Mateu 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:11">4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Ha matangua aje, Yesu uahumine ku Nazaleta cifuti camu Ngalileya, kaha vamumbuitikile kuli Yiuano mu ndonga ya Yundau. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Kaha omo Yesu uahumine mu mema, hajevene uamuene melu ashokoloka, kaha Cimbembesi uashulukilile hali ikeye mucifua ca livembe. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Kaha lizi liahumine muilu ngualio, “U Munange injazanga, muli yove njivuahelela.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Hajevene Cimbembesi ua mutualele mu mpambo. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Kaha uakele mu mpambo matangua makumi auana, mukumueseka kuli Satana. Uakele nakuyoya na vikashama kaha tungelo vamusimpisile.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asana vandongisi vakulivanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mateu 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Hanima yakukuta Yiuano, Yesu uayile ku Ngalileya, mukuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Njambi, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Ntsimbu inalishulisisa, Vumuene vua Njambi vuli muyehi, tengulukeni, kaha tsilieleni mu Muzimbu Uacili.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Kaha omo uakele nakuhita kumukulo ua cisali ca Ngalileya, uamuene Simoni na munaina Anduleo valinakuta manda avo mu cisali, muomu vapuile vakakuta vantsi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Omo Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Njikaveni njimipuise vakakuta vantu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Hajevene vasezele manda avo kaha vamukavele.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Kaha omo uatualeleleho kuenda, uamuene Yakomba muna Zembendeo na Yiuano munaina, vaje vakele mu vuato vuavo nakutungulula manda avo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Hajevene uavasanene kaha vasezele ishavo Zembendeo mu vuato hamo na vangamba vaje va vakumuine, kaha vamukavele.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahumisa cimbembesi cacipi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu na vandongisi vauana vayile ku Kapenauma, kaha omo liapuile lia Sapalalo uakovelele mu njivo ya malombelo na kulongesa. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Kaha vakomokele hakulongesa cendi, muomu uavalongesele ngue uje ali na nzili yakama, keti ngue muvakalongesela valongisi va mashiko.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Hajevene mu njivo ya malombelo muakele yala uje uakele na cimbembesi cacipi, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />kaha uatambekele nguendi, “Utonda vika kuli yetu, Yesu ua ku Nazaleta? Uneja nakutunongesa ndi? Njakuzivuka yove uje Umo Uakulela ua Njambi.” <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Kaha Yesu uamutenukilile nguendi, “Holoka kuluu, huma muli ikeye!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Kaha cimbembesi cacipi ca mupindisile, nakulila na lizi liakutambeka, kaha cahumine muli ikeye. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Kaha vantu voshe valikomokelele, nakulihozola umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Nkuma cika eci? Cilongesa caciha! Na nzili yakama asa kushika cipue cimbembesi cacipi, kaha cimuononoka.”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Kaha hajevene lutsimo luendi lua tsimanene ku mitambela yoshe ya kuzenguluka Ngalileya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa vantu vavengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateu 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Hajevene Yesu uahumine mu njivo ya malombelo, kaha uakakovelele mu njivo ya Simoni na Anduleo, hamo na Yakomba na Yiuano. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Honi vainamueno ya Simoni vakosele muomu vakele nakuvavala lisika sika, kaha hajevene valekesele Yesu kuvavala cendi. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Kaha uezile nakumukuata ku livoko, uamuhinduile, kaha masika sika amuecelele, uaputukile kuvapangela.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Kaha ku cinguezi, omo litangua lia lahukile Yesu vamunehelele voshe vaka kuvavala na vaje vakele na mahamba. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Kaha vantu voshe va mu nganda valikunguluile hamo ku cikolo. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu uakanguisile vavengi vaka kuvavala mishongo yakuliseza seza, nakuhumisa mahamba amengi, kaha katavesele mahamba kuhandeka, muomu amuzivukile.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ambulula mu Ngalileya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Kaha ku cimene mene Yesu uahindukile, nakuya ku cihela calikaliendi lika nakulombela. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Kaha Simoni na vaje vakele nendi, vamukavele nakumutonda, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Vamu uanene kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Muntu uoshe alinakukutonda.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Tuyeni ku vinganda via kulihata, linga naua njikambulule Muzimbu nakuje, muomu eci cikeco cinjezilile.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Kaha uayile muoshe mu Ngalileya, nakuambulula Muzimbu Uacili mu vinjivo via malombelo avo nakuhumisa mahamba.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala ua mbumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateu 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Kaha uje yala uakele na mbumba uezile kuli Yesu nakumulambelela, uatsikamene nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nga utonda, njipuise uakulela.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu hakuvua ngozi, uoluele livoko liendi na kumukuata, nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njitonda, lela.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Hajevene mbumba ya holele, kaha uapuile uakulela. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Uamunanguile cikuma, nakumuleka linga aye vuasi vuasi, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />nakumuleka nguendi, “Keti uhandeke cuma cimo kuli uoshe, vuno honi ya, linga ukalimuese yove vavenia kuli kasasendote, kaha ukahane nkombelo ije Mosesa uashikile ha kulela cove linga ipue vukaleho ku vantu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Vuno honi uayile nakuhandeka oku nazituka, kaha Muzimbu uashanduokelele kuoshe, linga Yesu keti akovela mu nganda citona muelu, vuno honi uayile ku mitambela yeka ya cifuti, kaha vantu vakele nakuija kuli ikeye mu vintsimbu.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala ua kalepa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateu 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Hanima ya matangua amandende, Yesu uahilukile naua mu Kapenauma, kaha vantu vovuile nguavo Yesu nahiluka kuimbo. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Vantu vakungulukile muvuingi, kaha kukuakele cipue mulili umo uasaleleko uahi, cipue hambanza ya cikolo, kaha uambuluile lizi kuli vakevo. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Vamo vamala vauana vambatele yala ua kalepa kaha vamunehele kuli Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Kaha omo vahonouele kushuena kuli Yesu muomu ya civunga, vatuvile mbengua ha ciluli mukemo vasoselele cije citala tala cije uje yala uakalepa ha kosele na kucineha ha mavu. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Kaha omo Yesu uamuene lutsilielo luavo, uahandekele kuli uje muka kalepa nguendi, “Munange vipi viove vana vikonekela.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Nankuma vamo valongisi va lishiko vaje vatumamene kuje, vakele na kulihuozola mu mitima yavo nguavo, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Vika ou yala ahandekela ngacije? Alinakushaula! Iya asa kukonekela vipi, vuno honi kuvanga lika Njambi?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Hajevene Yesu mu cimbembesi uazivukile vivakele na kusinganieka mu mitima yavo, kaha uavehuile nguendi “Vikahoni muli na kulihozola mu mitima yeni? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Cili cinapu cacasi, kuhandeka kuli muka kalepa nguove, ‘Vipi viove vana vikonekela,’ indi kuhandeka nguove ‘Katuka, ambata citala tala cove uye?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Vuno honi njitonda nguange muzivuke ngueni Muna Muntu ali na nzili yakama ya kukonekela vipi hano ha mavu.” Uahandekele kuli uje yala ua kalepa nguendi, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Njikuleka nguange, katuka, ambata citala tala cove uye kuimbo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Kaha uakatukile, hajevene uambatele citala tala cendi nakuya oku vantu voshe vamumono, kaha vakomokele nakulemesa Njambi nguavo, “Kanda tumoneho cuma cakufua ngacije!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asana Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateu 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu uayile naua ku cikuma ca cisali, kaha civunga cakama cakungulukile kuli ikeye, kaha uaputukile kuvalongesa. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Kaha omo uahitile, uamuene Levi muna Alufeya, natumama ku njivo yakutambuila lisimu, kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njikave.” Kaha Levi uakatukile nakumukava.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Kaha omo uatumamene ku mesa mu njivo yendi, vuingi vua vakakutambula lisimu na vaka vipi vatumamene na Yesu na vandongisi vendi, muomu vavengi vamukavele. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Kaha valongisi va lishiko vaje vapuile Vafaliseho omo vamuene Yesu ali nakulia na vaka vipi na vakakutambula lisimu, vehuile vandongisi vendi nguavo, “Nkuma vika vialila na vakakutambula lisimu na vaka vipi?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Kaha omo Yesu vovuile eci, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vaje kuvavavala kuvasa kutonda cimbanda, vuno honi kuvanga lika vaje vavavala, kunjezile nakusana vaje vaka vusunga, vuno honi vaka vipi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha kuliumina kulia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateu 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Omo vandongisi va Yiuano na Vafaliseho valiuminine kulia, kaha vantu vamo vezile kuli Yesu nakumuihula nguavo, “Nkuma vatihoni vandongisi va Yiuano na vandongisi va Vafaliseho vakaluimina kulia, vuno honi vandongisi vove kuvekuliumina kulia?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma nga mungenzi neja ku ciuano ca vulo asa kuliumina kulia oku vavenia vulo ali navo ndi? Houe kuvasa kuliumina kulia nga vali na vavenia vulo. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Vuno honi matangua akeja, omo vavenia vulo vakamuhumisa kuli vakevo, ambahoni vakaluimina kulia.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Naumo uahi asa kutongela citopeko ca ntanga yaiha ha kazaku kalaja, nga alinga ngoco, kaha citopeko cikatavula kazaku kalaja nakuseza mbengua. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Kaha naumo uahi ahaka viniu via viha mu vinjeke via vilambu via laja, nga alinga ngoco, kaha viniu vitavula vilambu, kaha na viniu vikahita, na vilambu naua navikevio vikapihia, vuno honi viniu viaviha viapande kukala mu vilambu viaviha.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha litangua lia Sapalalo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateu 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Ha litangua limo lia Sapalalo Yesu uahitile mu mehia a tiliku, kaha omo vakele nakuhita vandongisi vendi vaputukile kutomona mitue ya vinona. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Kaha Vafaliseho vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Tala, nkuma vika valingila evi vivanavindika mu lishiko ha litangua lia Sapalalo?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Kanda mutandeho vije vialingile Ndaviti, omo uatsile njala kaha uatondele kulia, ikeye navaje vakele navo, <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />uakovelele mu njivo ya Nambi, omo Aviyatale uapuile kasasendote uakama ha ntsimbu ije, kaha ualile mbolo ya nkombelo ya Njambi ije kuyapuile lishiko kuli muntu uoshe kuvanga lika kuli vasasendote ku ilia, kaha naua uahaneneko nakuli vaje vakele navo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Sapalalo vaipangelele muomu ya muntu, kaha keti muntu muomu ya Sapalalo, <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />kaha Muna Muntu ikeye vene Muene cipue ha litangua lia Sapalalo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yala uakusekua livoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateu 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Yesu naua uakovelele mu njivo ya malombelo, muje muakele uje yala uakusekua livoko. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Kaha vamo va Vafaliseho vaje vatondele kuhana Yesu mulonga nankuma vamutalelele, linga vamone indi amukanguisa ha litangua lia Sapalalo. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Kaha uahandekele kuli uje yala uakusekua livoko nguendi, “Ija kuno.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Kuya ku lishiko lia Sapalalo, nkuma cinapu cacili kulinga muacili indi kuvulumuna, kuovola muono indi kutsiha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Vuno honi vaholokele kuluu. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Uavatalele oku tele naniengua, nakulivua vusiua ha kukolesa mitima yavo, kaha uahandekele kuli uje yala uakusekua livoko nguendi, “Olola livoko liove.” Ualioluele, kaha livoko liendi liakangukile. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Vafaliseho vatuhukilemo, kaha hajevene vali uanene hamo na mpunga ya Helonde linga vauane ngila ya kutsihilamo Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Civunga ca vantu ku cisali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu na vandongisi vendi vahumine ku cisali, kaha civunga cakama caku Ngalileya neci ca ku Yundeya camukavele, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />naku Yelusalema naku Indumeya vamo musinia ya Yundau, vamo vahumine ku Tile na Sindone, civunga cakama omo covuile vije vialingile vezile kuli ikeye. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Kaha Yesu ualekele vandongisi vendi linga vamuvuahesele vuato muomu ya civunga kuteua vamutseka, <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />muomu ya kukanguisa vavengi, ngeci navaje voshe vakele na mishongo vamusindikile linga vamukuate. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Kaha hoshe haje omo vaje vakele na vimbembesi via vipi vamumuene, vauililile ha mavu ku mesho endi nakutambeka nguavo, “Yove Muna Njambi.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Kaha uavashikile cikuma ngeci keti vamutsimanese.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahangula tunganda likumi na vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateu 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Kaha Yesu uayile helu lia munkinda, uasanene vaje vatondele, kaha vezile kuli ikeye. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Uahanguile likumi na vavali linga vakale nendi, ngeci avatume kuya nakuambulula, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na kukala na nzili yakama yakuhumisa mahamba. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Ava vakevo likumi na vavali vaje vahanguile, Simoni uje ya lukile Petulu, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakomba muna Zembendeo, na Yiuano munaina ya Yakomba, vaje valukile Mboanengesi, nkumbu yalio ngualio, “Vana va cililimo.” <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Anduleo, na Filipu, na Mbatolomeo, na Mateu, na Tomasi, na Yakomba muna Alufeya, na Tandeo, na Simoni uaku Kanana, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yundasa Sakaliote, uje uendele Yesu vungungu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamutumbula nguavo Mbelezembulu muene ua mahamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mateu 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Yesu na vandongisi vendi vakovelele mu njivo, kaha civunga caliuanene hamo naua, ngeci ikeye na vandongisi vendi vahonouele kulia. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Kaha omo ntanga yendi yovuile ha cuma eci, vayile naku muhumisako muomu vantu vakele nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nazaluka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Kaha valongisi va lishiko vaje vasikumukile kuhuma ku Yelusalema vahandekele nguavo, “Vali nakumupangesa kuli Mbelezembulu, muene ua mahamba ikeye namuhana nzili yakuhumisa mahamba.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Kaha Yesu uavasanene linga veje kuli ikeye, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo mu visimo nguendi, “Nkuma vati Satana asa kuhumisa Satana? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Nga vumuene vulipanga hakati kavuo vavenia, kaha vumuene vuje kuvukemana. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Nga njivo ilipanga hakati ikeyo vavenia, ije njivo kuikemana. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Kaha nga Satana aliluisa ikeye vavenia kaha nalipanga, kasa kuimana, vuno honi alinakuya ku mamanusuilo.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Naumo uahi akovela mu njivo ya yala ua nzili nakupukula vitenga viendi, cakulivanga kuvanga akute uje yala ua nzili, ambahoni apukule njivo yendi.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Cilivene, njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, vupi vuoshe vua vantu vakavukonekela, nakushaula kuje kuvakahandeka, <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />vuno honi uoshe uje ashaula Cimbembesi Uakulela ku vakamukonekela, muomu nalingi vupi vuayaye,” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />muomu vahandekele nguavo, “Alina na Cimbembesi cacipi.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaina na vamunaina ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateu 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Ambahoni vaina na vamunaina ya Yesu vezile nakuimana hambanza nakumutumina muntu linga amusane. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Kaha civunga cije camuzengelekele tele vatumama, vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Vanoko na vamuanoko vali hambanza, mu kukutonda.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Veya vanana na vamunanana?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Kaha omo uatalele vaje vamuzengelekele, uahandekele nguendi, “Ava vakevo vanana na vamunanana! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Uoshe uje alinga cizango ca Njambi, ikeye munanana ua yala, nou uampuevo, na vanana.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca muka kukuva vimbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateu 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu naua uaputukile kulongesa ku cikuma ca cisali. Civunga ca vantu calikunguluile kuli ikeye, kaha uakovelele nakutumama mu vuato ha cisali, tele civunga coshe cakele ku cikuma ca cisali ha ntunda. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Yesu uavalongesele viavingi mu visimo, kaha mu vilongesa viendi uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi,<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Ivuilileni! Muka kukuva uayile nakukuva vimbuto. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Kaha omo uakuvile, imo mbuto yauililile kumukulo ua ngila, kaha tuzila vezile naku ilia. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Imo mbuto yauililile ha mavue a mavue haje kuhakele livu lia lingi, kaha hajevene yasokele muomu kuhakele livu lia lingi, <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />kaha omo litangua lia tuhukile vije vimbuto via jujuamene, muomu mizi kuyakovelele cikuma mu mavu kaha yomine. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Ikuavo mbuto yauililile mu mingonga kaha mingonga yakolele nakuituva, kaha kuya hakele vinona. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Vikuavo vimbuto viauililile mu mavu acili, viasokele kaha viahakele vinona viavingi, viakolele nakulivuezelela kuima, vimo viemine makumi atatu, vikuavo viemine makumi atanu na limo, kaha vikuavo viemine cihita.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Uoshe ali na matuitui ovue.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua visimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateu 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Omo Yesu uakele likaliendi, kaha vaje vakele navo hamo na vandongisi vendi likumi na vavali vamuihuile via ha visimo. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Kuli yeni vanamihana vushueke vua Vumuene vua Njambi, vuno honi kuveka vioshe vili mu visimo, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />nankuma linga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">“Vamone</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">vuno honi keti vamonesese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">kaha linga vovue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">vuno honi keti vovuisise.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Omo nga valingamo vakatenguluke na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">kuvakonekela.”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alumbununa cisimo ca muka kukuva mbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateu 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma kumuesi nakuvuisisa eci cisimo ndi? Kaha nkuma vatihoni mukevivuisisa visimo vikuavo? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Muka kukuva akakuvu lizi. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Ava vakevo vantu vanalifu ngue vimbuto vije viauililile kumukulo ua ngila, kuje lizi valiambulula, kaha omo valivua, hajevene Satana eja nakuambata lije lizi livanambulula muli vakevo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Kaha vamo vantu vanapu ngue vimbuto vije vivakuvile ha livu lia mavue, omo vevua lizi, hajevene valitambula nanzolela, <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />kaha kuvesi na mizi muli vakevo, vuno honi kuvakasimbula nalio, kaha omo tuyando cipue mapakeso vikeja muomu ya lizi, hajevene vakaua. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Kaha vamo vanapu ngue vimbuto vije vivakuvile mu mingonga, ava vakevo vaje vevua lizi, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />vuno honi vakevo vahakela mana via ha mavu na kuzanga vufuko, kaha nalishungu lia viuma vieka vije vikovela nakutuva lizi, kaha kulimi vushuka. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Vuno honi vamo vanapu ngue vimbuto vije vivakuvile ha livu liacili, ava vakevo vanapu vaje vevua lizi nakulitambula na kuima vushuka vua kupua, makumi atatu na makumi atanu na limo, na cihita.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca ndeya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma muntu akanehe ndeya nakuihaka muntsi lia liendeko, cipue muntsa muhela ndi? Nkuma kaihaka ha citumbiko cayo ndi? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Muomu nacimo cahi cuma cakushueka, cihonoua kuija hakutoka, kaha naua nacimo cahi ca vushueke civahonoua kuneha ku ceke. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Nga uoshe uje ali na matuitui ovue.”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Niungeni vimuli na kuivua, seteko ije muhana ikeyo vakamihana neni naua, vuno honi yeni vakamivuezelelako. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Uoshe ali na viavingi vakamuvuezelelako, kaha uje kesi, cipue cije cali naco va kamutambulaco.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca mbuto yakusoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Vumuene vua Njambi vunapu ngue muntu akuva mbuto mu mavu, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />cipue vene akosa tulo omo ahinduka vije vimbuto visoka na kukola vutsiki na mutania, vuno honi kazivuka muvili nakukolelamo. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Cakulivanga mavu akahaka cishati, kaha mutue, kaha vinona ku mitue. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Vuno honi omo vimbuto vinahi, hajevene uavitejele na mpoko ya kutejesa muomu ntsimbu ya kuteja yahetele.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca mbuto ya musalata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31">Mateu 13:31</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Vumuene vua Njambi tukavusetekesa na vika, cipue cisimo muka tukalikuasesa hali vukevuo? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Vunapu ngue nona ya musalata, ije omo vaikuva mu mavu, kaha ikeyo yapua yaindende cikuma ku vimbuto vioshe via ha mavu. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Vuno honi omo vaikuva kaha ikakola na kupua yakama kupulakana viputa vioshe, kaha ikahaka mintango yakama, ngeci tuzila va muilu vapangeleho mashua mu cimbembe cayo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Muomu ya visimo viavingi evi, Yesu uahandekele lizi kuli vakevo kuya nomu muvahaselele kuvivuisisa. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Kahandekele kuli vakevo kuakuhona cisimo, vuno honi kumukulo uakele nakulumbunuina vandongisi vendi viuma vioshe.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aholuesa mankimba akama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateu 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Ha litangua lije, omo capuile cinguezi, Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Tuyeni musinia lia cisali.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Kaha omo vasezele civunga vayile nakukovela nendi mu vuato. Kaha kuakele na mato eka kuje. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Kaha mankimba akama a mpunzi ezile, aputukile kukovela mu vuato, na vuato vuaputukile kushula na mema. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Vuno honi Yesu uakele kuntongo ya vuato uakosele tulo oku najendamena ha musato, kaha vamuhinduile nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguavo, “Mulongisi, ku uazivukile nguove tutsa ndi?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Kaha uahindukile nakutenukila mpunzi, uahandekele ku mankimba nguendi, “Ciyulo! Holoka!” Mpunzi yaholokele, kaha kuakele kuholoka cakama kuluu. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vika muteua? Nkuma kumuesi na lutsilielo ndi?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Kaha vakele na liova, vahandekele kuli umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Iya honi ou, cipue mpunzi na mankimba vimuvuila?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala ua vimbembesi viavipi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateu 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesu na vandongisi vendi vayile musinia lia cisali, ku cifuti ca Ngelasa. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Kaha omo uahumine mu vuato, ualiuanene na yala ha vihilo uje uakele na cimbembesi cacipi, <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />uakele nakukala ha vihilo, kaha naumo muntu uahi uasele kumukuta, cipue na malienge, <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />muomu lualuingi vakele nakumukuta na tukunju na malienge, vuno honi uakele nakuvatuzola malienge na kupokozola tukunju mu vimbazuvuila, kaha naumo uahi uakele na nzili ya ku muononuesa. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Vutsiki na mutania uakele ha vihilo na ha minkinda oku alila, nakulivetuesa ikeye vavenia na mavue.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Kaha omo uamuene Yesu kulahako, uashatukilile kuli ikeye na kumulemesa, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />kaha ualilile na lizi liakutambeka nguendi, “Nkuma vika utonda kuli yange, Yesu, Muna Njambi ua Helu lia Vioshe? Njilomba mu lizina lia Njambi, keti unjiyandese.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Muomu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Huma muli ou yala, yove cimbembesi cacipi!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Ambahoni Yesu ua muhuile nguendi, “Yove iya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Kaha uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yange civunga, muomu tuvavengi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Kaha uamulambelele cikuma ngeci keti amusheke mu cifuti cije.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Nankuma kuakele vutanga vua vangulu vaje vakele na kulia kuje ku munkinda, <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />kaha vije vimbembesi viavipi via mulombele nguavio, “Tushekele kuje ku vutanga vua vangulu, linga tukakovele muli vakevo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Kaha uavatavesele. Kaha vije vimbembesi viavipi viamuhumine, kaha viakovelele mu vutanga vua vangulu, nankuma vangulu voshe vapuile makulukazi avali, kaha vashatukile nakukakovela mu cisali muje muvakanongelelele.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Vaje tuniungi vateuele, kaha vakalekele vije vivamuene mu nganda na mu cifuti. Kaha vantu vezile nakumona vije vialingiuile. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Omo vezile kuli Yesu, vamuene uje yala uakele na vimbembesi viavipi natumama kuje, nazala muacili na mana acili anahiluka muli ikeye, yala uje uakele na vimbembesi viavingi viavipi, kaha vateuele. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Vaje vacimuene vakahandekele vije vialingiuile kuli uje yala uakele na vimbembesi viavipi naku vutanga vua vangulu.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ambahoni vaputukile kulambelela Yesu linga ahume mu cihela cavo.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Omo uatondele ku kovela mu vuato, uje yala uakele na mahamba uamulambelele linga akale nendi.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Vuno honi Yesu ua vianene, kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Ya kuimbo kuli vavusamba vove, ukavalekese via nakulingila Muene, nomu muanakela na cikeketima hali yove.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Nankuma uje yala uayile na kuputuka kuambulula mu Ndikapolisi (kulumbununa vinganda likumi) viuma vije viamulingilile Yesu. Kaha vantu voshe valikomokelele.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muna Njailosi ua mumbanda na mpuevo uje uakuatele ku kazaku ka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateu 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Omo Yesu uajavukile naua mu vuato kuya musinia lia cisali, civunga cakama ca vantu cakele nendi, kaha uakele ku cikuma ca cisali. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ambahoni kuezile umo mukuluntu uamu njivo ya malombelo, lizina liendi Njailosi, omo uamuene Yesu uauililile ku viliato viendi, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />uamulambelele nguendi, “Munange ua mpuevo alinakutonda kutsa. Ija ukamusaleke mavoko ove, linga akanguke na kuyoya.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Nankuma Yesu uayile nendi. Civunga cakama ca mukavele oku vamusindika.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Kaha kuakele mpuevo uakele na kuhita maninga ha miaka likumi naivali, <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />uje uayandele cikuma ku vimbanda, uapihisile viuma vioshe viakele navio, vuno honi kakangukile, vuno mushongo uendi uatualeleho kuya kuintsi cikuma. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Kaha omo uovuile lutsimo lua Yesu, uamukavele munima yendi mu civunga na kumukuata ku kazaku kendi. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Muomu uahandekele nguendi, “Nga njikakuata cipue lika ku kazaku kendi kaha njikakanguka.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Kaha hajevene aje maninga emanene, kaha uovuile mu muvila uendi nguendi nakanguka ku mushongo uendi. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Kaha Yesu uovuile nzili yahumine mu muli ikeye, kaha hajevene uatengulukilile ku civunga nakuhandeka nguendi, “Iya nakuata ku kazaku kange?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Kaha vandongisi vendi vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Unamono civunga cili nakutusindika vuno honi uhandeka nguove, Iya nanjikuata ndi?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Vuno honi Yesu uatalele talele linga amone uje ualingile eci. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Ambahoni uje mpuevo ha kuzivuka cije calingiuile kuli ikeye, uezile kuli Yesu na liova oku alina kujaja nakuuila ku viliato viendi, nakumuleka vusunga vuoshe. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Munange ua mpuevo, lutsilielo luove luakukanguisa, ya mu ciyulo kaha kanguka ku mushongo uove.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Omo tele Yesu acili nakuhandeka kaha kuezile vantu vaje vahumine ku njivo ya Njailosi uje uapuile ntuama ua njivo ya malombelo kaha vamo vahandekele nguavo, “Munove ua mpuevo natsi. Nkuma vika uyandesela Mulongisi naua?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Vuno honi Yesu kahakeleko mana kuli vije viva handekele, kaha uahandekele kuli muka kuyula ua mu njivo ya malombelo nguendi, “Keti uteue, tsiliela lika.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yesu katavesele muntu uoshe kumukava kuvanga lika Petulu na Yakomba na Yiuano munaina ya Yakomba. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Omo Yesu uahetele ku njivo ya muka kuyula ua njivo ya malombelo, uamuene vitanga, na vantu valila nakukangoka cikuma. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Kaha omo uakovelele, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma vika mukangoka na kulila? Muanike katsile vuno honi nakosa tulo.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Kaha vamujolele. Vuno honi voshe uavatuhuisile hambanza, kaha uambatele vaishe na vaina ya muana na vandongisi vaje vakele navo, kaha vayile muje muakele uje kanike. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesu uakuatele uje muanike ua mpuevo ku livoko nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, “Talita kumi.” Kulumbununa, “Muanike ua mpuevo, njihandeka kuli yove nguange hinduka.”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Hajevene uje muanike ua mpuevo uahindukile na kuenda (uakele na miaka likumi na ivali), kaha voshe valikomokelele. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Kaha uavashikile cikuma nguendi, keti kukale cipue umo napande kuzivuka eci, kaha uavalekele vamuhane viakulia ngeci alie.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu vamuviana ku Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateu 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu uahumine kuje na kuya ku cifuti liendi, kaha na vandongisi vendi vamukavele. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Ha litangua lia Sapalalo uaputukile kulongesa mu njivo ya malombelo, kaha vavengi vaje vamuvuile valikomokelele nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma ou yala kulihoni kuanauana evi vioshe? Nkuma mana muka vamuhanene ikeye? Nkuma akalingi vati evi vikomoueso viendi! <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Nkuma ou keti ikeye muka kushonga, muna Maliya na munaina ya Yakomba na Yosefa na Yundasa na Simoni ndi? Kaha vamunaina va vampuevo kutuesi navo hano ndi?” Kaha vakevo vamuvianene.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Kananguizi kuveku musingimika mu cifuti cendi, naku vantu vendi na mu njivo yendi vavenia.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Kaha kalingile vikomoueso viakama kuje, kuvanga lika kusaleka mavoko endi ku vantu vavandende vaka kuvavala na kuvakanguisa. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Kaha Yesu ualikomokelele muomu yakuhona lutsilielo luavo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu atuma vandongisi likumi na vavali</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateu 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Ambahoni Yesu uendanganene mu membo na kulongesa. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Kaha uasanene vaje likumi na vavali nakuvatuma linga vaye vali na vavali, nakuvahana nzili yakama yakuhumisa vimbembesi viavipi. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Uavashikile nguendi “Keti vambate cimo mu vungenzi vuavo kuvanga lika mbueti, kuakuhona mbolo, cipue cola, cipue vimbongo mu vimboloso viavo, <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />vuno honi vazale vinkaku keti kuzala vikovelo vivali.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Mu njivo yoshe mukovela, tumamenimo kutuala noho mukahuma mu cihela cije. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Kaha nga cihela coshe cije kuvamitambula na kuviana kumivuilila, omo mukahumamo, litotomoneni likungu ku viliato vieni linga vupue vukaleho vueni hali vakevo!”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Nankuma vayile nakuambulula nguavo vantu vapande kutenguluka. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Kaha vahumisile mahamba vavengi, nakuvuavesa vantu vavengi vaka kuvavala na mazi nakuvakanguisa.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa ca Yiuano muka kumbuitika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateu 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Omo muene Helonde uevuile nguendi lizina lia Yesu liatsimanene cikuma. Kaha vamo vahandekele nguavo, “Yiuano muka kumbuitika na sanguka kuvatsi, mukemo evi vinzili vili nakupanga muli ikeye.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Vuno honi vamo vahandekele nguavo, “Ikeye Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Veka naua nguavo, “Ikeye kananguizi, ngue ua vamo vaje tunanguizi va laja.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Vuno honi omo Helonde uovuile eci uahandekele nguendi, “Yiuano uje njavatuile mutue nasanguka ku vatsi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Muomu Helonde uatumine linga vakuate Yiuano, na kumukuta na kumutuala mu kamenga, ualingile eci muomu ya Helondiya, mpuevo ya munaina Filipu muomu uamuambatele. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Muomu Yiuano uahandekele kuli Helonde nguendi, “Keti lishiko kuambata mpuevo ya munanoko.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Kaha Helondiya uakele na citela nendi, kaha uatondele kumutsiha vuno honi uahonouele, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />muomu Helonde uateuele Yiuano, muomu uazivukile nguendi uapua ua vusunga na kulela, kaha ua muniungile muacili. Omo vamuvuile, ualikomokelele mu mutima uendi, vuno honi cipue ngoco uamuvuililile.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Omo litangua lije liasemukile Helonde liahetele, uavuahesele viakulia via vaka kuyula na vaka kushika vaje vahumine ku Ngalileya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Kaha kuezile muna Helondiya ua mpuevo na kukina, uavuahelesele Helonde na vangenzi vendi, kaha muene uahandekele kuli uje mumbanda nguendi. “Njilombe coshe cije utonda, kaha njikakuhanaco.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Kaha ua lisingile kuli ikeye nguendi, “Coshe ulomba kuli yange njikakuhana, cipue vene mbazuvuila ya vumuene vuange.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Kaha uayile hambanza, nakuihula vaina nguendi, “Vika njikalomba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Kaha vaina vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Lomba mutue ua Yiuano muka kumbuitika.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Hajevene uje mumbanda uezile kuli muene nakulomba nguendi, “Njitonda linga unjihane mutue ua Yiuano muka kumbuitika ha lilonga hano vene.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Kaha muene uakele na vusiua vuakama, vuno honi muomu ha kulisinga cendi na vangenzi vendi, katondele kupokola mezi endi aje ahandekele kuli ikeye. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Kaha hajevene muene uatumine lisualale uje muka kuniunga kaha uamushikile linga anehe mutue ua Yiuano. Kaha uayile nakumuteta mutue mu kamenga, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />kaha vanehele mutue mu lilonga, nakuhana uje mutue kuli uje mu mbanda, kaha uje mumbanda uauhanene vaina. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Omo vandongisi va Yiuano vacuvuile, vezile nakuambata muvila uendi, naku utsinda mu cihilo.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahana viakulia makulukazi atanu a vantu (5, 0 0 0)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateu 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yiuano 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Tunganda vahilukile kuli Yesu, na kumulekesa vioshe vije vivalingile na vije vivalongesele. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Tuyeni ku cihela calikalietu, tukahuimeko kavundende.” Muomu vavengi vakele na kuija nakuya, kaha kuvauanene cipue ntsimbu ya kulia. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Kaha vakovelele mu vuato nakuya ku cihela cakulishueka kua likaliavo.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Nkuma vavengi vavamuene oku valinakuya, naua vavazivukile, kaha vashatukilile kuli Yesu kuhuma ku vinganda vioshe, kaha uavauanene kulutue luendi. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Omo Yesu uayile ha ntunda uamuene civunga cakama, kaha uavovuilile ngozi, muomu vapuile ngue vampanga vakuhona kaniungi, kaha naua uaputukile kuvalongesa viuma viavingi. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Omo capuile cinguezi, vandongisi vendi vezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguavo, “Cino cinapu cihela ca kulishueka naua kuatoko, <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />valeke vaye na kuzenguluka mu cifuti na mu membo vazenguluke linga vakalilandele viakulia vakevo vavenia.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Vuno honi Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Vahaneni viakulia valie.” Kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">“Nkuma tuye nakulanda vimbolo mu vimbongo viakupua vihita vivali via muuaya uaya ua siliva, linga tuvahane valie ndi?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muli na vimbolo vingahi? Yeni mukamone.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Kaha omo vandongisi vendi vayile nakumona, vahandekele nguavo, “Kuli vimbolo vitanu, na vantsi vavali.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ambahoni uavashikile nguendi, vatumame ha mavu ha vishoni mu vivunga. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Kaha vatumamene ha mavu mu vivunga, mu vihita na mu makumi atanu. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Kaha Yesu uambatele vimbolo vitanu na vantsi vavali kaha uatalele muilu, nakuvikuisula, kaha uapazuile vije vimbolo, uahanene vandongisi vendi linga vahane vantu, kaha uavapangelele vaje vantsi vavali voshe. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Voshe valile nakukuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Vandongisi va Yesu vakunguluile vimbazuvuila via vimbolo na vantsi vije viasaleleho via kupua mitonga likumi na ivali. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Kaha vamala vaje valile vije vimbolo vapuile vamala makulukazi atanu.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu enda ha mema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mateu 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yiuano 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Hajevene Yesu ualekele vandongisi vendi linga vakovele mu vuato vaye kulutue luendi musinia lia Mbetesainda, tele ikeye acili na kushandola civunga. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Kaha omo uavasezele, uayile ku munkinda na kulombela. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Kaha omo capuile cinguezi, vuato vuakele hakati ka cisali kaha uakele likaliendi ha ntunda.<verse eid="MRK 6:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Kaha uamuene vandongisi vendi vali mu vukalu vua kujavula vuato muomu mpunzi yakele na kuvaluisa. Kaha omo ntsimbu kanda kuce, uezile kuli vakevo, oku ali nakuenda ha mema. Tele uatondele kuya kuli vakevo, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />vuno honi omo vamumuene ali na kuenda ha mema vasinganiekele nguavo ndumba ya muntu, kaha vatambekele cikuma, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />nankuma omo vamumuene, kaha vovuile liova cikuma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Vuno honi hajevene Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Keti muteue, yange vene.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Uakovelele mu vuato navo kaha na mpunzi yaholokele. Kaha valikomokelele cikuma, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />kuvovuisisile via vije vimbolo, muomu vakolesele mitima yavo.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa vaka kuvavala mu Ngenesaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mateu 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vajavukile cisali, vahetele ku Ngenesaleta, kaha vakutile vuato ku cikuma. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Omo vahumine mu vuato, hajevene vantu vazivukile Yesu, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />kaha vashatukilile mu vihela vioshe viakulihatako kaha vaputukile kuneha vaka kuvavala ha vitala tala viavo nakuvatuala kuoshe kuje kuva muvuililile. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Kaha kuoshe kuje kuayile, ku membo, namu vinganda cipue mu cifuti, vakosesele vaka kuvavala ha vitala tala viavo kuje ku vihela viakulandesela, vamulambelelele linga vaje vaka kuvavala vamukuate ku mukunduilo ua kazaku kendi, kaha voshe vaje vakuateleko vakangukile.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via vakukuluila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mateu 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Honi omo Vafaliseho na vamo valongisi va mashiko vaje vahumine ku Yelusalema vakungulukile kuli Yesu, <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />vamuene nguavo vamo va vandongisi vendi vali na kulia na mavoko a kuhona kulela, aje akuhona kutana.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(Muomu Vafaliseho na Vayunda voshe, kuve kulia kuakuhona kutana ku mavoko, mukuniunga cisemua ca vakuluntu vavo. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Omo vahuma ku vihela via kulandesela, kuve kulia kuvanga valilelesa vakevo vavenia, kaha kuli visemua viavingi vikuavo vivakaniungu, ngue via kukusha vinganja na vindeho na vitenga via kupanga ha vunengu)<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Kaha Vafaliseho na valongisi va mashiko vehuile Yesu nguavo, “Nkuma vika honi vandongisi vove kuve kuyoya kuya ku cisemua ca vakuluntu, vuno honi vakali na mavoko akuhona kulela?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Isaya uahandekele muacili ha vunanguizi vuendi hali yeni vaka civembulu ngue muje uacisonekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“Vantu ava, vanjilemesa na tunua tuavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">vuno honi mitima yavo ili kulako nange.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Vanjilemesa muangoco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">vilongesa viavo vinapu via vuntu!<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Yeni kumue kukavangeya lishiko lia Njambi, vuno honi mukatualelelaho kulinga cisemua ca vantu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Munasembulula lishiko lia Njambi, linga muniungilemo cisemua ceni! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Muomu Mosesa uahandekele nguendi, ‘Singimika isho na noko’, kaha, ‘Uoshe ahandeka via vipi hali ishe cipue vaina, cilivene napande kutsa’, <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />vuno honi muhandeka ngueni, Nga muntu aleka ishe cipue vaina nguendi, ‘Viunapandele kunganiala kuli yange inapu Kombani’ (kulumbununa, vanacihana kuli Njambi), <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Kaha ku umutavesa kulinga cuma coshe kuli ishe cipue kuli vaina, <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />eci cinapu kuteua lizi lia Njambi mu cisemua ceni cije muakuata. Kaha evi vikevio viavingi vije mukalingi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Viuma vije vilingisa muntu kupua uakuhona kulela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mateu 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesu naua uasanene vantu linga veje kuli ikeye, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Njivuilileni, muva voshe, nakuvuisisa. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Nacimo cahi cihuma hambanza lia muntu cije cikovela muli ikeye cije cihonoua kumulelesa, vuno honi viuma vije vihuma muli muntu vikevio vimupuisa linga keti apue uakulela.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Nga uoshe uje ali na matuitui evuilile.<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Omo Yesu uakovelele mu njivo, nakuseza vantu, vandongisi vendi vamuihuile ha cije cisimo. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma neni naua,” kumuesi nakuvuisisa ndi? Nkuma kumumono ngueni, “vioshe vije vikovela muli muntu viakuhuma hambanza kuviasa kuhona kumulelesa, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />muomu ku cekukovela mu mutima uendi, vuno honi muzimo liendi, kaha na kupulakana.” (Nankuma mucifua eci Yesu natavesa viakulia vioshe kuvilia)<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vije vikahumu muli muntu vikevio kuviekulelesa muntu. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Muomu mukati ka mutima ua muntu mukemo mukahumu visinganieka via vupi, na vukoyi, na kuiva, na kutsiha, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />na vupangala, na kuliveya, nakulinga viuma vioshe via vipi, na kukuisa, na mesho mesho, na cipululu, na vungumba, na kulihalesa na vulema. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Viuma vioshe evi via vipi vikahuminina mukati ka mutima, kaha nakupuisa muntu kuhona kupua uakulela.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lutsilielo lua mpuevo uaku Kanana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mateu 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu hakuhuma kuje uakatukile nakuya ku cihela ca Tile na ku Sindone. Kaha uakovelele mu njivo cakuhona muntu uoshe kuzivuka, vuno honi kasele kulishueka. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Hajevene kuakele mpuevo uje uakele na munendi ua muanike ua mpuevo uje uakele na cimbembesi cacipi, uovuile via Yesu, kaha uezile kuli ikeye nakuuila ku viliato viendi. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Nankuma uje mpuevo uapuile Kangelengu, uasemukilile ku Fonisiya mu Siliya. Kaha ualambelele Yesu linga ahumise lihamba muli munendi. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Eceni vanike vavandende valivange kulia, muomu keti cacili kuambata mbolo ya vanike na kuyashela tutali.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Vuno honi uje mpuevo uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Eyo Muene, cipue vene tutali vaje vavutama muintsi lia mesa valia visaniu vije vauisa vanike!”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Muomu yakuhandeka ngacije uasa kuya, lihamba linahumu muli munove.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Kaha uje mpuevo uahilukile kuimbo, uakauanene muanike nakosa ha muhela, na lihamba liamuhumu.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala ua kasenda matuitui na kalaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Ambahoni Yesu uahumine ku cihela ca Tile uahitile mu Sindone na kuya ku cisali ca Ngalileya, nakuheta mu cihela ca Ndikapolisi (kulumbununa vinganda likumi) <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Kaha vantu vanehele yala kuli Yesu uje uapuile kasenda matuitui na kalaka, kaha valambelelele Yesu linga a musaleke mavoko endi. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu uamuhumisile ha civunga ca vantu nakuya nendi kua likaliavo, uakovelesele minie yendi mu matuitui endi, uajekuile nakumukuata ha ndaka yendi, <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />kaha Yesu uatalele muilu, kaha uasisimukile nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, “Efefata,” kulumbununa nguavo, “Shokoloka.”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Kaha matuitui endi ashokolokele na kalaka kaje kakuatele ndaka yendi kazitukile, kaha uaputukile kuhandeka muacili. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu uashikile vantu linga keti valekeko cimo kuli uoshe, vuno honi cipue uavashikile ngoco ambahoni vatualeleleho kuambulula. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Kaha vantu vakomokele cikuma nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nalingi viuma vioshe muacili, cipue tusinda matuitui vovua na tuveveve vahandeka.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahana viakulia makulukazi auana a vantu (4,000)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mateu 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Ha matangua aje, omo civunga cakama naua cakungulukile, kaha vahonouele viakulia, Yesu uasanene vandongisi vendi, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Njivua ngozi ha civunga eci, muomu vanakala nange honi matangua atatu kuakuhona kulia, <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />kaha nga njivaleka nguange vaye na njala ku membo avo, vasa kulezumukila mu ngila muomu vamo vanahumu kulahako.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Kaha vandongisi vendi vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Iya asa kulisa vantu ava na mbolo muno mu mpambo?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muli na vimbolo vingahi?” Vahandekele nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">“Vitanu na vivali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Kaha uashikile civunga linga vatumame ha mavu, kaha uambatele vimbolo vitanu na vivali kaha uatsantselele na kuvipazula, kaha uahanene vandongisi vendi linga vahane vaje vantu, kaha vahanene ku civunga. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Vakele na vantsi vavandende, kaha hanima ya kuvakuisula uashikile naua linga avahanevo.<verse eid="MRK 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Kaha valile nakukuta, kaha vakunguluile vije vimbazuvuila vivasezeleho viapuile mitonga itanu na ivali yakushula. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Vantu voshe vapuile ngue makulukazi auana. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Kaha uavalekele linga vaye, kaha hajevene Yesu uakovelele mu vuato na vandongisi vendi vayile ku nganda ya Ndalamanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vafaliseho valomba cimueso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mateu 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Vafaliseho vezile kuli Yesu nakuputuka kulinga nendi vimpata, vatondele linga avalingile cimueso cakuhuma muilu, ngeci vamueseke. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu ualisisumuine mu Cimbembesi cendi nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nkuma vika vantu va cikota cino vatondela cimueso? Muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, na cimo cahi cimueso cikalingiua ku cikota cino.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Kaha uavasezele, uakovelele mu vuato nakuya musinia lia cisali.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zangameni ku vilinga via Vafaliseho na Helonde vije viafua ngue cimbaluila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mateu 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Honi vandongisi vasuvile kuambata vimbolo, kaha vakele lika na mbolo imo mu vuato. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu uavananguile nguendi, “Liniungeni nakuzangama ku cimbaluila ca Vafaliseho na cimbaluila ca Helonde.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Vandongisi vakele nakuhandeka kuli umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Kutuesi na mbolo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Omo Yesu uacizivukile, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma vika muhandekela ngueni kumuesi na mbolo? Ku muazivukile cipue kuvuisisa ndi? Nkuma vati mitima yeni inakolo? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Muli na mesho vuno honi nkuma kumumono, muli na matuitui nkuma kumuvu ndi? Nkuma naua kumuvuluka ndi? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Omo njapazuile vimbolo vitanu kuhana vantu makulukazi atanu, muakunguluile mitonga ya vimbazuvuila ya kushula ingahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Vakumbuluile nguavo “Likumi na ivali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Kaha naua omo njapazuile vimbolo vitanu na vivali kuhana vantu vakupua makulukazi auana, muakunguluile mitonga ya vimbazuvuila ya kushula ingahi?” Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Itanu na ivali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma naku ntsimbu ino hanga ku muvuisisa ndi?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala ua kapuputua ku Mbetesainda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesu na vandongisi vendi vayile ku Mbetesainda. Kaha vantu vamo vanehele muntu umo kuli ikeye uje uapuile kapuputua, valambelelele Yesu linga amukuate. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu uakuatele uje yala ua kapuputua ku livoko, kaha ua muhumisile hembo, omo uamujekuilile malenzi ha mesho endi, uamusalekele mavoko endi kaha uamuhuile nguendi, “Ulinakumonako cimo ndi?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Uje yala uatalele kuilu nakuhandeka nguendi, “Njimona vantu, vuno honi valinakumoneka ngue miti ili na kuenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu naua uamusalekele mavoko endi ha mesho endi, kaha uamutalele ntooma ambahoni uakangukile, kaha uamuene vioshe muacili. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu uamulekele ngeci aye kuimbo liavo, uamulekele nguendi, “Keti ukovele cipue muimbo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu atava ngeci Yesu ikeye Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mateu 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu uatualeleho kuya na vandongisi vendi ku membo a Sesaliya Filipu, kaha omo vayile mu ngila Yesu uehuile vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Vantu vahandeka nguavo Yange iya?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Kaha vamulekele nguavo, “Vamo vahandeka nguavo yove Yiuano Muka kumbuitika, vamo naua nguavo yove Eliya, vamo nguavo yove umo ua vaje tunanguizi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Kaha uavehuile nguendi, “Vuno honi yeni munjisana ngueni yange iya?” Petulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yove Kilistu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Kaha uavashikile nguendi keti valekeko cipue muntu umo hali ikeye.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka viakulutue via tuyando tuendi na kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mateu 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ambahoni Yesu uaputukile ku valongesa nguendi Muna Muntu napande kuyanda mu viuma viavingi, nakumuviana ku vakuluntu na kuli vasasendote vakama na kuli valongisi va mashiko, na kumutsiha kaha hanima ya matangua atatu akasanguka naua. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Uavalumbunuinine eci muacili kuli vakevo. Kaha Petulu uamutualele kuali kaliavo nakuputuka kumutenukila. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Vuno honi omo uatengulukile nakumona vandongisi vendi, uatenukilile Petulu nakuhandeka nguendi, “Huma kuli yange Satana! Muomu kuuesi kumutambela ua Njambi, vuno honi uli kumutambela ua vantu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Ambahoni Yesu uasanene civunga ca vantu hamo na vandongisi vendi linga veje kuli ikeye, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nga kuli uoshe atonda kunjikava, napande kuliviana ikeye vavenia kaha ambate cilindakano cendi na kunjikava. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Muomu uoshe uje ayoyesa muono uendi akauzimbalesa, kaha uoshe azimbalesa muono uendi muomu yange na Muzimbu Uacili aka uyoyesa. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Nkuma cikuasa vika kuli muntu kuli kunguluila cifuti coshe na kuzimbalesa muono uendi? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Nkuma cuma cika muntu asa kuhingisa mu muono uendi? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Muomu uoshe uje anjivuila shuamua, na mezi ange mu cikota cino ca vupangala na vupi, na Muna Muntu naua akamuvuila shuamua, omo akeja mu vumpau vua Ishe na tungelo va kulela.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu uatualeleleho kuhandeka nguendi, “Cilivene, njimileka nguange, kuli vamo vanemana hano kuvakatsi kuvanga noho vanamono Vumuene vua Njambi mu vuija na nzili.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhimpuka ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mateu 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Hanima ya matangua atanu na limo Yesu uambatele Petulu na Yiuano na Yakomba kaha vayile ku munkinda ualaha kua likaliavo, kaha Yesu uahimpukile ha mesho avo, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />na vuzalo vuendi vua viazimine, nakutoka cikuma, kaha naumo uahi hano ha mavu asa kukusha kutokesa eci kupulakana muje. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Hakati kavo kuasholokele Eliya na Mosesa, vaje vakele nakuhandeka na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Ambahoni Petulu uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Muene, muacili tuli hano, tutunge vintsingi vitatu, imo yove kaha ikuavo ya Mosesa na ikuavo ya Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Kazivukile viakele nakuhandeka, muomu vateuele cikuma.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Kaha mashelua avafuikile, na lizi lia huminine mu lishelua ngualio, “Ou ikeye Munange injazanga, muvuilileni.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Kaha hajevene omo vatalele kuvamuene cipue umo kuvanga Yesu lika.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Kaha omo vakele nakusikumuka kuhuma ku munkinda, uavashikile linga keti valekeko cipue umo ha viuma vije vamuene, kuvanga noho Muna Muntu akasanguka ku vatsi.<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Kaha valiniungilile evi vimpande vakevo vavenia, nakulihuozola nguavo, “Kusanguka ku vatsi cilumbununa vika.” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Kaha vamuihuile nguavo, “Muomu vika valongisi va mashiko vahandeka nguavo Eliya napande kulivanga kuija?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Eliya alivanga kuija nakuhiluisa viuma vioshe evi, nkuma vacisoneka vati hali Muna Muntu, nguavo napande kuyanda mu viuma viavingi na kumuviana ndi? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Vuno honi njimileka nguange Eliya neja laja, kaha vamulingile muoshe muvatondelele, ngue muje vacisonekele hali ikeye.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa muanike ua yala uje uakele na cimbembesi cacipi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mateu 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luka 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Omo vezile kuli vandongisi vakuavo, vamuene civunga cakama cavazenguluka, kaha na valongisi va lishiko vakele nakulinga vimpata navo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Hajevene omo civunga coshe ca mumuene calikomokelele kaha vayile kuli ikeye nakumumeneka. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Kaha Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Nkuma vika mulina kulinga navo vimpata?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Umo uavaje mu civunga uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Mulongisi, njinaneha munange ua yala kuli yove, muomu ali na cimbembesi ca vuveveve, <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />kaha hoshe hacimu uanena cimbembesi cacipi, cimuuisila ha mavu, kaha a huma lifulu ku kanua na kulishumanga ku mazo kaha ominina ngoo, njalombele vandongisi vove linga vacihumise, vuno honi vacihonouele kucihumisa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Ambahoni Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Haa yeni cikota cakuhona lutsilielo, njikakala neni ha ntsimbu yakupua hali? Nkuma vintsimbu vingahi honi njinapande kuyanda neni? Munehe kuli yange!” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Vamunehele kuli ikeye, kaha omo cimbembesi cacipi camuene Yesu, hajevene capindisile uje muanike ua yala, kaha uauililile ha mavu nakulialumuna, nakuhuma lifulu ku kanua. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu uehuile ishe nguendi, “Ntsimbu yakupua hali uaputukile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">“Kaha uahandekele nguendi, kuputuka ku vuanike vuendi.” <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />“Lualuingi cimbembesi cacipi cikamuuisila mu tuhia na mu mema, linga cimutsihe, vuno honi lingaho cimo, tuivuileko ngozi nakutukuasa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nga uasa! Viuma vioshe vinapu via viasi kuli uje atsiliela.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Hajevene ishe ya uje muanike uatambekele na kuhandeka nguendi, “Njitsiliela, njikuase yange uakuhona lutsilielo!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Omo Yesu uamuene civunga cilinakuija hamo nakushatuka, kaha uatenukilile cije cimbembesi cacipi nakuhandeka kuli cikeco nguendi, “Yove cimbembesi cavuveve navusenda matuitui, njikushika, huma muli ikeye, kaha keti ukamuhilukile naua.”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Cije cimbembesi catambekele nakumushiniisa muakama, kaha cahumine, uje muanike ua lezumukile, kaha vavengi vasinganiekele nguavo, “Natsi.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Vuno honi Yesu uamukuatele ku livoko naumukatula kaha uakatukile.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Kaha omo uakovelele mu njivo, vandongisi vendi vamuihuile mu vushueka nguavo, “Vika honi tuahonouelele ku cihumisa?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Cifua ca cimbembesi eci kucasa kuhuma lika kuvanga na lilombelo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka naua via kulutue via ha kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mateu 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu na vandongisi vendi vahumine kuje kaha vatualeleho noho vahitile mu Ngalileya. Kaha Yesu katondele muntu umo linga azivuke kuje kuvaya, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />muomu uakele nakulongesa vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Muna Muntu vakamuhana mu mavoko a vantu, kaha vakamutsiha, nga vanamutsihi, kaha hanima ya matangua atatu a kasanguka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Vuno honi kuvevuisisile vije viahandekele, kaha vateuele kumuihula.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iya uakama cikuma?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateu 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Yesu na vandongisi vendi vezile ku Kapenauma. Omo vakele mu njivo, Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Vika munakala nakulingila vimpata mu ngila?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Vuno honi vaholokele, muomu mu ngila vakele nakulinga vimpata nguavo iya uakama cikuma. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu uatumamene nakusana vaje likumi na vavali, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nga uoshe atonda kupua uakulivanga, apue uakumanusuilila ku voshe na kupua ngamba ua voshe.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Kaha uambatele muanike, nakumuhaka mukati kavo, kaha uamuambatele mu mavoko endi, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi,<verse eid="MRK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Uoshe uje atambula muanike uamundende mu lizina liange natambula yange, kaha uoshe uje atambula yange, katambuile yange vuno honi uje uanjitumine.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uoshe uje katuluisa alihamo netu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yiuano uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Mulongisi, tuamuene yala ahumisa mahamba mu lizina liove, kaha tuamuvindikile, muomu keti umo uetu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Keti mumuvindike,” muomu naumo uahi alinga vipangi viakukomouesa mu lizina liange uje muka ntsimbu naua ase kuhandeka via vipi hali yange. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Muomu uoshe uje katuluisa napu uetu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Cilivene njimileka nguange, uoshe uje amihana nganja ya mema akunua mu lizina liange, muomu muapandama kuli Kilistu, kakahonoua kuuana vuana vuendi.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vieseko vije vituala ku vupi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mateu 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Nga uoshe alingisa vanike vavandende vaje vanatsiliela muli yange kulinga vupi, cacili ngue muntu uangacije vamukutile livue liakama liakulolela vunga mu ntsingo yendi nakumumbila mu cisali. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Nga livoko liove likulingisa linga ulinge vupi, litete, cacili kuli yove kukovela mu muono na livoko limo kupulakana kukovela na mavoko avali aje akutuala ku ngehena, ku tuhia tuakuhona kuhua. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Muje mavuno amuo ke kutsa, na tuhia tuamuo kutue kuzima. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Nga mukono uove ukulingisa linga ulinge vupi uteteko, cacili kuli yove kukovela mu muono na vusualonda kupulakana kukovela na mikono ivali nakukumbila mu ngehena. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Muje mavuno amuo ke kutsa, na tuhia tuamuo kutue kuzima. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Nga lisho liove likulingisa linga ulinge vupi, licokovolemo, cacili kuli yove kukovela mu Vumuene vua Njambi na lisho limo kupulakana na mesho avali nakukumbila mu ngehena, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />muje mavuno vamuo kuve kutsa, na tuhia tuamuo kutue kuzima.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Muntu uoshe vakamulelesa na muongua mu tuhia.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Muongua uacili, vuno honi nga muongua uashamuka, ukapua vati naua muongua?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Pueni muongua yeni vavenia, kaha kaleni na ciyulo kuli umo na mukuavo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alongesa ha kutsiha vulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mateu 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Ambahoni Yesu uahumine kuje nakuya kucihela ca ku Yundeya na kutuvakana Yundau, kaha vivunga via vantu viakungulukile kuli ikeye naua, kaha naua, kuya ku kapandi kendi, uavalongesele.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Vafaliseho vezile nakumueseka kaha vamuihuile nguavo, “Nkuma capua lishiko yala kukondola mpueyendi ndi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nkuma Mosesa ua mishikile vika?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Vahandekele nguavo, “Mosesa uatavesele yala kusoneka mukanda uakukondola, na kumulekesa linga aye kuimbo liavo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Hakukola ca mitima yeni mukemo uamisonekelele eli lishiko. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Vuno honi hume hakuputuka ca kutanga, ‘Njambi uavatangele yala na mpuevo.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Muomu ya cuma eci yala akaseza vaishe na vaina naku kalipandakana na mpueyendi, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />kaha vaje vavali vakapua muvila umo. Nankuma kuvakapu vavali vuno honi muvila umo. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Cije Njambi napandakana hamo naumo muntu uahi napande kucihangununa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Omo vakele mu njivo, vandongisi va Yesu vamuihuile naua ha cimpande eci. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Uoshe akondola mpueyendi nakuambata ueka, alinga vupangala. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Mucifua cimo vene nga mpuevo akondola yaliendi nakukashomboka kueka, kaha nalingi vupangala.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuisula vanike vavandende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateu 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Vantu vakele nakuneha vanike kuli Yesu, linga a vakuate kaha vandongisi vendi vavatenukilile. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Vuno honi omo Yesu uacimuene uanienguele, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Eceleni vanike vavandende veje kuli yange, keti muvavindike, muomu Vumuene vua Njambi vunapu vuavo. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Cilivene njihandeka kuli yeni, uoshe uje katambula Vumuene vua Njambi ngue muanike uamundende ka kavukovela.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Kaha uavambatele mu mavoko endi na kuvakuisula nakuvasaleka mavoko endi.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yala uakufuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateu 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Omo Yesu uakele nakuya mu vungenzi vuendi, yala uashatukile na kuija na kutsikama ha mavuli kuli ikeye, na kumuihula nguendi, “Mulongisi uacili, nkuma njilinge vati linga njikasuane muono uayaye?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Vika unjitumbuila nguove njiuacili? Naumo uahi muntu uacili kuvanga Njambi lika. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Uazivuka mashiko aje ahandeka nguauo, ‘Keti utsihe, keti ulinge vupangala, keti uive, keti uhane vukaleho vua makuli, keti ukuise, singimika vaisho na vanoko.’”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Mulongisi, vioshe evi njaviniungu hume ku vuanike vuange.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu omo uamutalele kaha uamuzangele, kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Uahonoua cuma cimo, ya, ukalandese viuli navio vioshe, ngeci ukavihane ku vihutu, kaha ukakala na vufuko muilu, kaha ija, linga unjikave.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Omo uevuile evi uakotamesele cihanga cendi, kaha uayile na vusiua, muomu uakele na vufuko vuavuingi.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu uatalele talele, kaha uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Capua cacikalu kuli vaje vaka kufuka kukovela mu Vumuene vua Njambi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Kaha vandongisi vendi vakomokele ha mezi endi. Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo naua nguendi, “Vana vange, cacikalu vati kukovela mu Vumuene vua Njambi! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Cacasi kamelu kukovela mu lisho lia nguya kupulakana muka kufuka kukovela mu Vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Kaha valikomokele cikuma, vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Nkuma iya honi akovoka?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu uavatalele kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Ku vantu cacikalu, vuno honi keti kuli Njambi, muomu viuma vioshe viaviasi kuli Njambi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Petulu uaputukile kuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, “Tala, tuaseze viuma vioshe nakukukava.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Cilivene,” njimileka nguange, “naumo uahi naseze njivo cipue vamunaina va vamala cipue vamunaina va vampuevo cipue vaina cipue vaishe cipue vanike cipue mehia muomu yange na Muzimbu Uacili, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />iya kakatambula cihita mu ntsimbu ino, na vinjivo, na vamunaina va vamala, na vamunaina va vampuevo, na visemi va vampuevo, na vanike, na mehia, na mapakeso, na mu miaka ije ikeja ya muono uayaye. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Vuno honi vavengi vaje vakulivanga vakapua vakukotokela, kaha vakukotokela vakapua vakulivanga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka lua mucitatu via kulutue via ha kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateu 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesu na vandongisi vendi vakele mu vungenzi vuakuya ku Yelusalema, kaha Yesu uakele na kuvatuamenena kulutue, vandongisi vendi valikomokelele navaje vamukavele vovuile liova. Vambatele naua vaje likumi na vavali, uaputukile kuvaleka vije vikalingiua kuli ikeye. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Uahandekele nguendi, “Taleni, tulina kukanduka ku Yelusalema, kaha Muna Muntu vakamuhana ku vakuluntu va tutasesondote na valongisi va mashiko kaha vaka muhisa na kumutuala kukutsa, na kumuhana kuli vaje keti Vayunda, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />kaha vaka mushendumuna, na kumujekuila, na kumupupa, na kumutsiha kaha hanima ya matangua atatu vaka musangula.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulomba ca Yakomba na Yiuano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mateu 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Kaha Yakomba na Yiuano, vana va Zembendeo, vezile kuli ikeye, kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Mulongisi, tutonda utulingile vioshe vije tulomba kuli yove.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma vika vimutonda kuli yange kumilingila?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Tutavese linga tutumame umo ku livoko liove liacilio mukuavo kulia cimoshue mu vumpau vuove.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Kumuazivukile vika vije vimuli nakulomba. Nkuma muasa kunua nganja ije njinua, cipue kumimbuitika mu cimbuitikilo civanjimbuitikile naco ndi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Tuasa.” Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nganja ije njinua, neni mukainuina, kaha na cimbuitikilo cije vanjimbuitikile naco, cikeco neni vakamimbuitika naco, <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />vuno honi kutumama ku livoko liange lia cilio cipue lia cimuoshe keti yange kutava, vuno honi viavaje vavanavuahesela.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Kaha omo vaje vandongisi likumi vevuile eci, vanienguelele Yakomba na Yiuano. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yesu ua vasanene veje kuli ikeye kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muazivuka ngueni vaje vanapandele kuyula vaje keti Vayunda valiyongola nguavo vali na nzili hali vantu vavo, kaha naua vantuama vavo vali na nzili yakama hali vakevo. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Vuno honi ku cikafu ngoco hakati keni, vuno uoshe uje atonda kupua uakama hakati keni napande kupua ngamba yeni voshe. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Kaha naua uoshe atonda kupua ua kulivanga hakati keni napande kupua ndungo ua voshe. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Muomu Muna Muntu kezile mukumupangela vuno honi mukupanga, nakuhana muono uendi linga apatule vantu vavengi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu emuisa mesho a kapuputua Mbatimeo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateu 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yesu na vandongisi vendi vahetele ku Yeliko, kaha omo uakele nakuhumamo na vandongisi vendi na civunga cakama ca vantu, Mbatimeo, uje kapuputua mukakulomba, muna Timeo uatumamene kumukulo ua ngila. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Omo uovuile nguavo Yesu uaku Nazaleta, kaha uaputukile kutambeka nguendi, “Yesu Muna Ndaviti, njivuileko cikeketima!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Kaha vantu vavengi vamuvindikile, vamulekele nguavo aholoke, vuno honi uatambekele cikuma nguendi, “Muna Ndaviti, njivuileko cikeketima!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu uemanene kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Musaneni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Kaha vamusanene uje kapuputua, vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Simpa, katuka, alinakukusana.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Mbatimeo uombilile vuzalo vuendi kaha uemanene nakuya kuli Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Vika utonda linga njikulingile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Uje yala uakapuputua uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Muene, njitonda njimone.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Ya, lutsilielo luove lua kukanguisa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Kaha hajevene uatonene kaha uaputukile na kumukava.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akovela na kasingimiko mu Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateu 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yiuano 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vatondele kuheta kuyehi na Yelusalema, ku Mbetefanje na Mbetaniya, ku munkinda ua Oliveta, uatumine vandongisi vendi vavali, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni ku limbo lije lili kulutue lueni, kaha omo mu kakovelamo mukauana muna cimulu ivanakutu, uje kanda vacimulondeho laja, kaha muzituleni mumunehe kuno. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Nga umo ahandeka kuli yeni nguendi, ‘Nkuma vika mulingila eci?’ handekeni ngueni, ‘Muene alina kumutonda kaha tumuhiluisako naua mualolo.’”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Vayile, nakuuana muna cimulu vanamukutilila ku cikolo mu ngila, kaha vamuzituile. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Vaje vemanene kuje vahandekele kuli vakevo nguavo, “Nkuma vika mulinga kuli ou muna cimulu?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Kaha vavalekele muje muavalekelele Yesu, kaha vavecelele vayile nendi. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Vanehele uje muna cimulu kuli Yesu, kaha vajalele vuzalo vuavo hali uje muna cimulu, kaha Yesu uatumameneho. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Vavengi vajalele vintanga viavo mungila, vamo vajalele maputa a mintango ije vatetele ku mehia avo. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Kaha vaje vakele kulutue navaje vakele nakukavangeya munima vakele nakutambeka nguavo, “Hosana! Uakukuisula uje eja mu lizina lia Muene! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Vuakukuisula vumuene vua tatetu Ndaviti vuje vuli nakuija! Hosana ua muilu mulahako!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu uakovelele mu Yelusalema, nakukakovela mu njivo ya Njambi, kaha omo uatalele talele ku vioshe, naua omo tele kuatoko laja, kaha uayile ku Mbetaniya hamo na vandongisi vendi likumi na vavali.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asinga muti ua mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mateu 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Liamukuavo, omo vahumine ku Mbetaniya, kaha Yesu uatsile njala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Kaha uamuene muti ua mukuyu uje uakele kulahako uje uakele na maputa, kaha uayileko nguendi hamo akauanako vushuka. Omo uahetele kuli ukeuo, kauaneneko vushuka vuno honi maputa lika, muomu kuyapuile ntsimbu ya vushuka. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Kaha uahandekele kuli ukeuo nguendi, “Naumo uahi muntu akalia vushuka kuhuma kuli yove naua.” Kaha vandongisi vendi vovuileko.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aya ku Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateu 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yiuano 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vahetele ku Yelusalema nakukovela mu mbalanda ya Njivo ya Njambi, kaha uaputukile kusheka vaje vakele na kulandesa na kulandulula mu mbalanda ya Njivo ya Njambi, kaha uafulumikile vimesa via vaje vakele na kulandulula vimbongo na vituamo via vaje vakele na kulandesa mavembe. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Yesu katavesele naumo uahi kuambata cuma mu Njivo ya Njambi. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Kaha uavalongesele, nakuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma ku vacisonekele nguavo, ‘Njivo yange ikapua Njivo ya malombelo ya vaka mafuti oshe ndi?’ Vuno honi muaipuisa cihela ca vezi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Vakuluntu va vasasendote na valongisi va mezi a mashiko vacuvuile kaha vatondele ngila ya kumutsihilamo, vamuteuele, muomu civunga coshe cakomokele ha vilongesa viendi.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Omo cinguezi cahetele, Yesu na vandongisi vendi vahumine mu nganda.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cilongesa ca muti ua mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mateu 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Liamukuavo cimene omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vahitile, vamuene uje muti ua mukuyu unomu naku mizi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petulu uavulukile kaha uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Muene, tala! Uje muti ua mukuyu u uasingile unomu.”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Kaleni na lutsilielo muli Njambi. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Cilivene njimileka nguange, uoshe ahandeka kuli ou munkinda nguendi, ‘Katuka uliumbile mu cisali,’ kaha nga kalikanouela mu mutima uendi, vuno honi atsiliela nguendi vioshe ahandeka vikalingiua, kaha vaka mu lingilavio. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Nankuma njimileka nguange, vioshe mulomba mu lilombelo, tsilieleni ngueni muavitambula laja, kaha vikapua vieni. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Ntsimbu yoshe uimana nakulombela, konekela mukueni nga uli nacimo nendi, linga ishueni ali muilu akamikonekele ku milonga yeni. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Vuno honi nga kumukonekela, kaha na ishueni ua muilu kakamikonekela ku milonga yeni.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha Nzili Yakama ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateu 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesu na vandongisi vendi vezile naua ku Yelusalema. Kaha omo uakele nakuenda mu mbalanda ya njivo ya Njambi, vasasendote vakama, navalongisi va mezi a mashiko, na vakuluntu vezile kuli ikeye, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Nzili yakama muka uli na kulikuasesa hakulinga viuma evi, cipue iya uakuhanene nzili yakama linga ulinge evi?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Njimihula cihula, kaha munjikumbulule, kaha njimileka ha nzili yakama njili nakulikuasesa hakulinga evi viuma. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Cimbuitiko ca Yiuano cahumine muilu indi ku vantu? Njikumbululeni.”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Kaha valingile vimpata umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Nga tuhandeka nguetu, ‘Cakuhuminine muilu,’ kaha akahandeka nguendi, ‘Vika honi muateuele ku mutsiliela?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Vuno honi nga tuhandeka nguetu, ‘Cahuminine ku vantu?’” Vateuele vantu, muomu voshe vazivukile nguavo Yiuano uapuile kananguizi ua vusunga. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Kaha vakumbuluile Yesu nguavo, “Kutuzivuka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Cipue yange vene kunjimileke nzili yakama njilinakulinga nayo viuma evi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca vaka kupanga mu lihia lia vushuka vua viniu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateu 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesu uaputukile kuhandeka kuli vakevo mu visimo nguendi, “Yala uakunine lihia lia viniu, kaha uazinguluisileko cipatanga, kaha uahindile cina ca kukamuinamo viniu, naua uatungile kaposhi, nakusezela vaka kupanga, kaha uayile ku cifuti ceka. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Omo ntsimbu yakuteja yahetele, uatumine ngamba kuli vaka kupanga, linga vambateko vumo vushuka mu lihia lia viniu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Kaha vamukuatele na kumupupa, nakumusheka mavoko voko. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Kaha naua uatumine mukuavo ngamba, kaha vamuvulumuine ku mutue, nakumulinga muashuamua. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Uatumine mukuavo, na ikeye vamutsihile, kaha navakuavo veka naua vavalingile muje vene, vamo vavapupangele vamo vava tsihile. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Kaha kuasalele umo, muana ua yala yazangele, ha mamanusuilo uamutumine munendi kuli vakevo, nakuhandeka nguendi, ‘Vakasingimika munange.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Vuno honi vaje vaka kupanga vahandekele kuli umo na mukuavo nguavo, ‘Ou ikeye muna vavenia lihia, ijeni, tumutsihe, kaha vufuko vupua vuetu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Vamukuatele nakumutsiha, nakumumbila musinia lia lihia lia viniu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Ambahoni Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Vika honi, viakalinga uje vavenia lihia lia viniu?” Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Akeja nakutsiha vaka kupanga, nakuhana lihia lia viniu ku vantu veka. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Nkuma kumuatandele evi visoneka ndi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Livue lije vaka kutunga vavianene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">likelio linapu cisimi ca mumbango,<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />eci cikeco calingile Muene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">kaha cinapu cakukomokesa kuli yetu!’”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Kaha vesekele linga vamukute, vuno honi vateuele civunga ca vantu, muomu vasinganiekele nguavo nahandeka cisimo eci kuluisa vakevo, kaha vamusezele nakuya.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha kufueta lisimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateu 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Vafaliseho vamo na vamo vaka mpunga ya Helonde vavatumine ngeci vaye nakukuata Yesu kuya kuvihandeka viendi. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Kaha vezile nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguavo, “Mulongisi, tuazivuka nguetu uapua ua vusunga, kaha ku uekuteua muntu uoshe muomu ku uekutala muntu muafuilamo, vuno honi ukalongesa muavusunga ngila ya Njambi. Nkuma capandemo kufueta lisimu kuli Sezale, indi houe?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Tuvafuete indi keti tuvafuete? Vuno honi Yesu hazivuka civembulu cavo, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma vika munjesekela? Njineheleni mbongo ya muuaya uaya, njiyitale.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Vanehele ije mbongo ya muuaya uaya. Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma cihanga na lizina lieya evi viliho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Via Sezale.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Haneni Sezale vije viakundama kuli Sezale, na kuli Njambi vije viakundama kuli Njambi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Kaha voshe vakomokele hali ikeye.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha kusanguka ku vatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateu 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Vasanduki vezile kuli ikeye, vaje vakahandeka nguavo kukuesi kusanguka ku vatsi, kaha vamuihuile cihula nguavo, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Mulongisi, Mosesa uatusonekelele nguendi, ‘Nga muanaye atsa kaha naseze mpuevo, vuno honi kasezele muana, uje yala napande kuambata uje mpuevo, linga asemeneko vana vaje vanapandele kusemenako ikeye.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Mulizimo liavo vapuile vatanu na vavali, uakulivanga uambatele mpuevo, kaha omo uatsile kasemeneneko muana, <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Kaha ua mucivali uamuambatele, kaha nendi naua uatsile, kasemeneneko muana, na ua mucitatu na ikeye naua cifua cimo, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />kaha voshe kuvasemeneneko vana. Kumamanusuilo uje mpuevo uatsile. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Nkuma hakusanguka uje mpuevo a kapua ueya? Muomu voshe vaje vatanu na vavali uapuile mpueyavo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma ku muazivukile ngueni muapihisa, muomu kumuzivuka visoneka cipue nzili ya Njambi? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Muomu omo vakahinduka ku vatsi, kuvakambata cipue kushomboka, vuno honi vakapua ngue tungelo va muilu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Honi ha kusanguka kuvatsi, nkuma kumuatandele mu livulu lia Mosesa, hali lije liputa, muje Njambi uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Yange Njambi ua Avilahama, na Njambi ua Isake, na Njambi ua Yakomba?’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Keti Njambi uavakakutsa, vuno honi Njambi ua vakakuyoya, yove unapihisa.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lishiko liakama vikuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mateu 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Umo ua valongisi va mashiko uezile kaha ua vovuile valinga vimpata kuli umo na mukuavo, kaha hakumona ngeci Yesu uavakumbuluile muacili, vamuihuile nguavo, “Nkuma lishiko muka liakama cikuma ku mashiko oshe?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Liakama cikuma linapu eli, ‘Ivuilila, Yove Isaleli! Muene Njambi yetu, uapua Muene umo, <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />kaha mukazanga Muene Njambi yeni na mitima yeni yoshe, na miono yeni uoshe, na mana eni oshe, na nzili yeni yoshe.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Lishiko lia mu civali linapu eli, ‘Zanga mukueni ngue muje mu ualizanga yove vavenia.’ Kukuesi naua lishiko liakama cikuma lipulakana aua.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Mulongisi ua mashiko uehuile Yesu nguendi, “Uahandeka vusunga Mulongisi, muavusunga vene, uapua umo lika, kaha kukuesi ueka Njambi kuvanga ikeye lika, <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Munapande ku muzanga na mutima ueni uoshe, nakuvuisisa coshe, na nzili yoshe, nakuzanga mukueni ngue muje mu ualizanga yove vavenia, eci capulakana milambu yoshe ya kutsimika na vinkombelo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Omo Yesu uamuene nguendi nakumbulula na mana, uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Kuuesi kulahako na Vumuene vua Njambi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Kuhuma haje naumo uahi naua uamuhuile vihula vieka.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca hali Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateu 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Omo Yesu uakele nakulongesa mu njivo ya Njambi, uahandekele nguendi, “Cijavati honi linga vaka kulongesa mashiko vahandeke nguavo Kilistu muna Ndaviti? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Ndaviti vavenia, vamuvuavesele na Cimbembesi Uakulela kaha uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“‘Muene uahandekele kuli Muene yange nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">tumama ku livoko liange lia cilio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">kuvanga noho njikahaka vitozi vove ku viliato viove.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Ndaviti vavenia amusana nguendi ‘Muene,’ nkuma cipua vati honi linga apue munendi?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu anangula linga vazangame ku valongisi va mezi a lishiko</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateu 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Civunga ca vantu covuililile kuli ikeye nakuvuahelela. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Omo Yesu uakele nakulongesa uahandekele nguendi, “Zangameni kuli valongisi va mashiko, vaje vakayi nakuenda mu tuzaku tualaha linga vavasingimike ku vihela via kulandesela, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />na vituamo viacili via mu vinjivo via malombelo na vihela via kasingimiko via ku viuano, <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />vaje vaka pihisa vinjivo via vantuluue mukulimuesa ha kulombela malombelo alaha. Vakatambula kashitiko kakapi cikuma.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulambu ua ntuluue</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu uatumamene kuyehi na kuje kuvakalambuila milambu, kaha uakele nakutalelela vantu omo vakele na kuhaka vimbongo mu cikuama ca njivo ya Njambi. Vavengi vaka kufuka vakele nakulambuila vimbongo viavingi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Vuno honi ntuluue uakuhutua uezile, kaha ualambuile tuuaya uaya tuvali tua vunengu tuatundende. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yesu uasanene vandongisi vendi linga veje kuli ikeye, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Cilivene njimileka nguange, ou ntuluue uacihutu nalambula viavingi kupulakana voshe vaje vanalambula mu cikuama. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Muomu voshe vanalambuila kusetekesa na vufuko vuavo vuavuingi, vuno honi ikeye nalambuila kuya mukuhutua cendi kaha naua nalambuila vioshe vimbongo viakele navio, viaku muyoyesa mu vuyoye vuendi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka via kulutue via kunonga ca Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mateu 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Omo Yesu uahumine mu njivo ya Njambi, kaha umo ua vandongisi vendi uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Tala, Mulongisi, kuvuaha ca mavue aua na kuvuaha ca vinjivo evi!” <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nkuma uli nakumona evi vinjivo viakama ndi? Na limo liahi livue likasalaho helu lia likuavo, oshe vaka ombila kuti.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuyando na mapakeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateu 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Omo Yesu uatumamene ha munkinda ua Oliveta musinia lia njivo ya Njambi, Petulu na Yakomba na Yiuano na Anduleo vamuihuile kualikaliavo nguavo, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tuleke eci cikalingiua ntsimbu muka, nkuma cimueso muka cikalingiua omo vioshe evi vikalingiua?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu uaputukile kuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, “Zangameni linga keti umo akamikuise. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Vantu vavengi vakeja mu lizina liange nakuhandeka nguavo, ‘Yange vene Kilistu!’ Kaha vakakuisa vantu vavengi. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Omo mukevua vinzita na muzimbu ua vinzita, keti mukakomoke, evi vinapande kusholoka, vuno honi keti kukotoka ca mavu. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Muomu cifuti cikatengulukila cifuti cikuavo, vumuene vukatengulukila vumuene vukuavo, kukakala mandunduma ku mitambela yakuliseza seza, ku kakala njala yakama. Evi vinapu ngue kuputuka ca mushongo uakusema.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Vuno honi liniungeni yeni vavenia, muomu vakamituala ku vaka mpunga na kumisompa, kaha vakamipupa mu vinjivo via malombelo, kaha mukemana ha mesho a vanguvulu na vimiene muomu yange, ngeci muhane vukaleho ku mesho avo. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Vuno honi Muzimbu Uacili munapande ku uambulula tahi ku mafuti oshe. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Omo vakamineha ku kumisompa, na kumikuata keti mukateue vimukahandeka. Vuno honi mukahandeke vije vioshe vije vakamihana ha ntsimbu ijevene, muomu keti yeni muka vihandeka, vuno honi Cimbembesi Uakulela. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Muntu akenda munaina vungungu naku mutuala kukutsa, kaha ishe akalinga ngoco na munendi, kaha vana vakatengulukila visemi viavo naku vatsihisa, <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />voshe vakamizinda muomu yange. Vuno honi uoshe akatualelaho na kumamanusuilo akovoka.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cimueso ca shuamua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mateu 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Vuno honi nga mukamona cimueso ca shuamua ca kukomouesa cije cikaneha kunonga cinemana kuje kucapandele kuimana.” (Muka kutanda ovuisise), kaha vaje vali mu Yundeya vateuele ku minkinda, <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />uoshe uje ali helu lia njivo keti ashuluke ha mavu, cipue kukovela mu njivo yendi, linga ambate cuma, <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />uoshe uje ali mu lihia keti ahiluke kunima nakuambata cikovelo cendi. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Caluvinda kuli vaje vakemita na kuli vaje vakajamuesa mu matangua aje! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Lombeleni linga keti cikalingiue mu cisika. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Muomu ha matangua aje kukakala tuyando tuje kutuakeleko hume ha kutanga ca mavu aje Njambi uatangele kuheta na ntsimbu ino, kaha kutukakalako naua. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Nga Muene kakehesele matangua, nga na muntu uahi akovoka, vuno honi muomu ya vantu vendi vaje vahanguile, uakehesele ku matangua.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Ambahoni ntsimbu ije nga kukakala umo akamileka nguendi, ‘Taleni, Kilistu uno!’ cipue nguavo, ‘Taleni, uje ali kuje!’ Keti mutsiliele. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Muomu kukasholoka Vakilistu va makuli na tunanguizi va makuli nakulinga vimueso na vikomoueso linga vamizimbalese, nga casiua vazimbalese navaje vanahangula. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Vuno honi zangameni njamileke viuma vioshe ntsimbu kanda ihete.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuija ca Muna Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateu 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Vuno honi ha matangua aje hanima ya tuyando, litangua likazivala, kaha ngonde kuikatu ceke, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />na vintanga ntanga vikaua kuhuma muilu, na lilu likaninganga. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Kaha vakamona Muna Muntu eja mu mashelua, na nzili yakama na vumpau. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Ambahoni akatuma tungelo vendi nakukungulula vantu vendi vaje vahanguile mu vimbango viuana, kuhuma ku mamanusuilo a mavu nakumamanusuilo a melu.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cilongesa ca muti ua mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateu 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Lilongeseni cilongesa ca muti ua mukuyu, omo mintango ituikilila na kuhaka maputa, kaha muazivuka ngueni ntondue ili muyehi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Mucifua cimovene omo mumona viuma evi vilingiua, kaha muzivuke ngueni Muna Muntu ali muyehi, ku cikolo. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Muavusunga njimileka nguange, vantu ava vali nakuyoya ntsimbu ino kuvakatsi kuvanga viuma vioshe evi vinalingiua. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Melu na mavu vioshe vikahua, vuno honi mezi ange ku akahu.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naumo uahi azivuka litangua cipue ntsimbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mateu 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Vuno honi naumo uahi azivuka litangua cipue ntsimbu, cipue vene tungelo va muilu, cipue Muana, vuno honi Tate lika. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Nangukeni, taleleleni, muomu ku muzivuka ntsimbu muka akeja. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Cinapu ngue yala uje nayi mu vungenzi, kaha omo ahuma hembo aseza vangamba vendi linga vaniunge, umo na umo na vipangi viendi, nakushika muka kuniunga ku cikolo linga atalelele. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Nankuma taleleleni, muomu kumuziva ntsimbu muka ije vavenia njivo akeja, indi ku cinguezi, cipue mukati ka vutsiki, cipue ha vandemba cipue ku cimene. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Nga eja vuasi keti akumiuane muakosa tulo. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Kaha evi vinjimileka vikevio vinjileka naku voshe nguange, taleleleni!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua kutsiha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateu 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yiuano 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Kaha kuasalele lika matangua avali linga Paseka na ciuano ca mbolo yakuhona cimbaluila vihete. Kaha vakuluntu va vasasendote na valongisi va mashiko vakele nakutonda ngila yavushueke ya kukuatelamo Yesu nakumutsiha. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Kutuapandele ku cilinga ha ciuano, mpamo hamo vantu vakaneha mpindangano.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vavuavesa Yesu ku Mbetaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateu 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yiuano 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Tele Yesu ali ku Mbetaniya mu njivo ya Simoni uje uakele na mbumba. Tele Yesu natumama ku mesa na kulia, mpuevo uezile kuli ikeye na ntsazi yakupanga ha livue lia kutoka ya kushula na mazi andando nakunika na luengo luacili. Uapazuile ije ntsazi kaha uetilile ku mutue ua Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Vuno honi kuakele vamo vaje vahandekele kuli umo na mukuavo oku vananiengua nguavo, “Vika vana pihisila aua mazi? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Muomu mazi aua vanapandele ku alandesa ha ndando ya vihita vitatu via muuaya uaya (300) nakuvihana ku vihutu!” Kaha valiniengele cikuma hali uje mpuevo.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Mueceleni, vika mu mumupakesela? Nalingi cuma cacili kuli yange. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Muomu yeni ntsimbu yoshe muli na vihutu, kaha naua ntsimbu yoshe mutonda muasa kulinga muacili kuli vakevo, vuno honi kumukakala nange ntsimbu yoshe. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Nalingi muanasela, na vuavesa muvila uange mukunjivuahesela kunjitsinda. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Muavusnga njimileka nguange, kuoshe kuje kuvakambulula Muzimbu Uacili ha mavu hoshe, canalingi vakacihandeka mu kumuvuluka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yundasa atava kuenda Yesu vungungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateu 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Ambahoni Yundasa Sakaliote, umo ua vaje vandongisi likumi na vavali, uayile ku vakuluntu va vasasendote linga akande Yesu vungungu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Omo vovuile vije viahandekele va vuahelele, kaha vamukulahesele kumuhana vimbongo. Kaha Yundasa uaputukile kutonda ngila ya kuendelamo Yesu vungungu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alia na vandongisi vendi ku ciuano ca Paseka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateu 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22:7-14</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yiuano 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ha litangua liakulivanga lia mbolo yakuhona cimbaluila, omo valingile nkombelo ya mpanga ua ha Paseka, vandongisi vendi vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Nkuma kuli utonda linga tukavuahese kuje ukalila Paseka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Kaha uatumine vandongisi vendi vavali, kaha uavalekele nguendi, “Yeni mu nganda kaha mukauana yala nambata ntsuua ya mema kaha akeja kuli yeni, kaha mukamukave, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />kaha muje muakakovela mukahandeke kuli vavenia njivo ngueni, ‘Mulongisi nguendi, ulikuli mulili ua vangenzi, muje njinapandele kulila Paseka hamo na vandongisi vange?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Kaha akamimuesa mulili uakama uakuvuahesa vuino uli helu ya milili ikuavo, kukeko mukavuahesa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Vandongisi vendi vaputukileko nakuya kuje ku nganda, kaha vakauanene ngue muje vene muava lekeselelemo, kaha vavuahesele Paseka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Omo capuile cinguezi uezile na vandongisi vendi likumi na vavali. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Tele omo vakele ku mesa na kulia, Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Muavusunga vene njimileka nguange, umo ueni akanjenda vungungu, umo uje alinakulia nange.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Vaputukile kulinienga, nakumuihula umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Yange ndi?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Umo ua vandongisi likumi na vavali, umo uje atanta hamo nange mbolo mu lilonga. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Muomu Muna Muntu akaya ngue muje muvanacisoneka hali ikeye, vuno honi tuyando hali uje yala nende vungungu Muna Muntu! Ngue capuile cacili uje yala ngue kasemukile.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mesa ya Muene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mateu 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolinte 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Kaha honi omo vakele nakulia, Yesu uambatele mbolo, na ku ikuisula, uaipazuile, naku ihana kuli vandongisi vendi, kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Ambateni, ou ukeuo muvila uange.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Ambahoni uambatele nganja naua, kaha muamanusuile kutsantsela uavahanene, kaha voshe vanuinemo. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Aua akeuo maninga ange a litavasano, aje anahitikila vavengi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Muavusunga vene njimileka nguange, kunjikanuho naua neni viniu kuvanga noho ha litangua lije omo njikanua viniu via viha mu Vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Omo vamanusuile kuimba muaso, vahuminemo nakuya ku munkinda ua Oliveta.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka via kulutue ngeci Petulu akamuviana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateu 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yiuano 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Muva voshe mukateua, muomu vacisoneka nguavo, ‘Njikapupa kaniungi, kaha vampanga vakalishandoka.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Vuno honi hanima yakunjisangula, njikaya kulutue lueni ku Ngalileya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petulu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Cipue voshe vakateua, vuno honi yange kunjikateue.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu uahandekele kuli Petulu nguendi, “Muavusunga vene njikuleka nguange, vutsiki vuno vene, ntsimbu kanda ndemba atambeke luvali, ukanjiviana lutatu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Vuno honi Petulu uavianene cikuma nguendi, “Nga kutsa nove kaha njikatsa, kunjikakuviana.” Kaha voshe vahandekele cifua cimo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alombela mu Ngetesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateu 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Yesu na vandongisi vendi vezile ku cihela civasanene Ngetesemani, kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Tumameni hano ntsimbu njilombela.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Ambahoni uambatele Petulu, na Yakomba, na Yiuano, kaha uaputukile kuzeya na kuvua vusiua. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Njivua vusiua vuakama mu mutima uange, cipue ku kutsa, tumameni hano mutalele.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Uayile halahako kavundende, kaha uatsikamene ha mavu nakulombela nguendi, nga casiua, eyi ntsimbu imutuvakane. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Tate, Tate, viuma vioshe via viasi kuli yove, humisa eyi nganja kuli yange, vuno honi keti ngue ku cizango cange, vuno honi cizango cove cilingiue.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ambahoni omo Yesu uahilukile uavauanene vakosa tulo, kaha uahandekele kuli Petulu nguendi, “Simoni, nkuma unakosa ndi? Nkuma ku uasa kutona cipue ha ntsimbu imo lika ndi? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Toneni na kulombela linga keti mukovele mu vieseko, cimbembesi cili vene atonda, vuno honi muvila unazeye.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Kaha naua uayile na kulombela, uakahandekele mezi a cifua cimo. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Kaha naua uahilukile ua vauanene vakosa tulo, muomu mesho avo alemene, kaha kuvazivukile mua kumukumbuluila.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Kaha uehilukile lua mucitatu, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma hanga muacikosa na kuhuima ndi? Muapuisamo, ntsimbu inahete. Taleni, Muna Muntu vanamuende vungungu nakumuhana ku mavoko a vaka vipi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Hindukeni, tuyeni, taleni, muka kunjenda vungungu neja.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamukuata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateu 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yiuano 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Hajevene, omo tele Yesu alina kuhandeka, Yundasa uezile, uje uapuile umo ua vandongisi likumi na vavali kaha uakele na civunga ca vantu cije cambatele mikuale na vimbueti, vahumine ku vakuluntu va vasasendote na valongisi va mashiko naku vakuluntu va Vayunda. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Kaha honi uje muka kuenda vungungu uavahanene cimueso nguendi, “Uje umo njikatsemba ikeye yala mukakuata nakumuniunga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Hajevene omo Yundasa uezile, uayile kuli ikeye kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Mulongisi!” Kaha uamutsembele. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Nankuma vakuatele Yesu na mavoko avo nakumukuta. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Vuno honi kuakele uje umo uemanene kumukulo uahumisile mukuale uendi nakuteta lituitui lia ngamba ua kasasendote uakama. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma muneja ngue muluisa muhuza, na mikuale na vimbueti mukunjikuata ndi? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Hatangua na tangua njinakala neni mu njivo ya Njambi nakulongesa, kaha ku muanjikuatele. Vuno honi linga visoneka vilishulisise.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Ambahoni vandongisi vendi voshe vamusezele, na kuteua.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Kaha mukuenje umo uamukavele, na cimo cahi cazalele mukati kuvanga lika cikovelo ca liniu, kaha vatondele kumukuata, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />vuno honi uasezele ije ntanga ya liniu nakuteua kuakuhona vuzalo.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vasompa Yesu ku mpunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mateu 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Yiuano 18:13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14">14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:24">19:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Vatualele Yesu kuli kasasendote uakama, kaha vakuluntu va vasasendote na vakuluntu, na valongisi va mezi a mashiko vakungulukilile hamo. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petulu uamukavele halahako, ku cipango ca kasasendote uakama, kaha uatumamene na vaka kuniunga nakuota tuhia. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Kaha honi vakuluntu vavasasendote na mpunga yoshe vatondele vukaleho hali Yesu linga va mutsihe, vuno honi ku vavuuanene vuahi. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Muomu vavengi vahandekele vukaleho vua makuli hali ikeye, vuno honi vukaleho vuavo ku vualitombuele.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Vamo vemanene nakuhandeka vukaleho vua makuli hali ikeye, nguavo, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Tuamuvuile ahandeka nguendi, ‘Njikapihisa eyi njivo ya Njambi yakutunga na mavoko, kaha mu matangua atatu nji katunga ikuavo naua, ije keti ya kutunga na mavoko.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Kaha cipue ngoco vene vukaleho vuavo kuvua litombuele.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Kaha uje kasesondote uakama uemanene hakati kavo, uehuile Yesu nguendi, “Nkuma kuuesi na viakuvakumbulula ndi? Nkuma cuma muka eci vantu vali nakukuvangeya hakuhana vukaleho vua makuli hali yove?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Vuno honi Yesu uaholokele kuakuhona kuvakumbulula. Kaha naua kasasendote uakama uamuhuile nguendi, “Nkuma yove Kilistu, Muana ua Njambi Uakukuisula ndi?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Yange vene, kaha mukamona Muna Muntu natumama ku livoko liacilio lia Njambi ua Nzili Yoshe, kaha akahuminina muilu mu mashelua.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Kaha uje kasasendote uakama uatavuile vuzalo vuendi, uahandekele nguendi, “Nkuma vika tutondela naua vakaleho vakuavo? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Munevu muanashaula. Nkuma vika muyongola?” Kaha voshe valitavasanene nguavo napande kutsa. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Vamo vaputukile ku mujekuila, nakumukuta ha mesho, nakumupupa, nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguavo, “Handeka vunanguizi!” Kaha vaka kuniunga vamupupile vinkome.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu aviana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mateu 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yiuano 18:15-18</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Omo Petulu tele acili mucipango umo ngamba ua mpuevo ua kasasendote uakama uezile kuyehi nendi. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Kaha omo uamuene Petulu ali nakuota tuhia, uamutalele ntooma, kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nove vene, uakele na Yesu uaku Nazaleta.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Vuno honi uavianene nguendi, “Kunjimuzivuka, kaha kunjivu vika uli nakulumbununa,” kaha uatuhukile nakuya.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Kaha uje ngamba ua mpuevo uamumuene kaha naua ualekesele vaje vemanene nendi nguendi, “Ou yala nendi vene umo uavo!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Vuno honi Petulu uavianene naua.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Ha kantsimbu kakandende lika vaje vemanene kuje vahandekele kuli Petulu naua nguavo, “Cilivene nove u umo uavo, muomu u Kangalileya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Vuno honi Petulu uaputukile kuhandeka visingo hali ikeye vavenia nguendi, “Njilisinga nguange kunjimuzivuka ou yala muli nakuhandeka!”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Kaha hajevene ndemba uatambekele lua mu civali, kaha Petulu uavulukile vije viahandekele Yesu kuli ikeye nguendi, “Ntsimbu kanda ndemba atambeke luvali, ukanjiviana lutatu nguove ku unjizivuka.” Kaha ualilile.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu vamutuala kuli Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateu 27:1-2</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yiuano 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Omo tele cimene vakuluntu va vasasendote na vakuluntu, na valongisi va mezi a mashiko, na vaka mpunga voshe valiuanene nakukuta Yesu nakumutuala kuli Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Kaha Pilato uamuhuile nguendi, “Nkuma yove Muene ua Vayunda ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Kaha Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Omo vene munahandeka.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Kaha vakuluntu vavasasendote vamuvangeyele viuma viavingi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Kaha Pilato uamuhuile naua nguendi, “Kuuesi na cikumbululo ca kuhandeka ndi? Tala viuma vi vali nakukuvangeya.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Vuno honi Yesu kamukumbuluile, kaha Pilato ualikomokelele.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamusompela kutsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateu 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yiuano 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Kaha ha ciuano ca Paseka, Pilato uakele nakuvahumisila umo ua vinzinda mu kamenga uje ivakele nakutonda vantu. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Hakati ka vinzinda vaje vakele mu kamenga, vaje vaka kutsiha vantu omo ya mpindangano, hakele yala ivatumbuile nguavo Mbalambasa. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Kaha civunga cezile nakuputuka kulomba Pilato linga alinge ngue muje muakalingila kuli vakevo ntsimbu yoshe. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nkuma mutonda njimihumisile Muene ua Vayunda ndi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Muomu uazivukile nguendi capuile kutonda lika kua vakuluntu vavasasendote linga vatuale Yesu kuli ikeye.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Vuno honi vakuluntu vavasasendote vashongangeyele civunga linga pilato ahumise Mbalambasa. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato uahandekele kuli vakevo naua nguendi, “Nkuma njilinge vika nou yala ou umutumbula ngueni Muene ua Vayunda?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Kaha vatambekele cikuma naua nguavo, “Mushukike.”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vika, nkuma vupi muka vuanalingi?” Vuno honi vatambekele cikuma nguavo, “Mushukike.” <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Omo Pilato uatondele kuvuahelesa civunga ca vantu, uavahumisilile Mbalambasa. Kaha uapupile Yesu na kuvahanaye linga vamushukike.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masualale vashendumuna Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mateu 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yiuano 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Masualale vamutualele mu lipela (mu cipango ca Nguvulu) Kaha vasanene voshe masualale. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Vazikile Yesu ntanga ya vunengu, nakuzenga cilongo ca vimbimbo nakumuzika. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Kaha vaputukile kumumeneka nguavo, “Haaa, Muene ua Vayunda!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Vamupupile ku mutue na lihongo, nakumujekuila, kaha vatsikamene nakumulemesa. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Hanima ya kumushendumuna, vamushuluile ije ntanga ya vunengu, nakumuzika vuzalo vuendi. Kaha vamutualele nakumushukika.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamushukika ha cilindakano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateu 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yiuano 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Kaha valiuanene na yala umo ua lizina lia Simoni uaku Silene, uje uezile mu cifuti uapuile ishe ya Elekizanda na Lufuse, kaha vamusindiyiye linga ambate cilindakano. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Vatualele Yesu ku cihela vatumbuile nguavo Ngolongota (kulumbununa nguavo cihela ca cikola) <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Kaha kuje vamuhanene viniu viakushingasana na miila, vuno honi Yesu kavinuine. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ambahoni vamushukikile ha cilindakano, nakulipangezela vuzalo vuendi hakati kavo, na kuta nkela linga vauane muntu na muntu ambataho cika. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Kaha yapuile ntsimbu ya mu citanu na viuana ku cimene, omo vamushukikile. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Kaha vasonekeleho canukiso ca kumuvangeya nguavo, “Muene ua Vayunda.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Vashukikile vezi vavali hamo na Yesu umo ku livoko lia cilio mukuavo ku livoko lia cimoshue. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Mu ngila eyi vene visoneka viapuilemo vije vihandeka nguavio, “Vamushukikile hamo na vaka vupi.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Kaha vaje vakele nakuhita vamushauile, na kuningangesa mitue yavo, na kuhandeka nguavo, “Haa! Yove uasa kupihisa njivo ya Njambi na kuitunga naua mu matangua atatu, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />liyoyese yove vavenia, kaha shuluka ha cilindakano!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Kaha naua mucifua cimovene vakuluntu va vasasendote na valongisi va mezi a mashiko vamushendumuine, na kuhandeka nguavo, “Uayoyesele vakuavo vuno honi kasa kuliyoyesa ikeye vavenia, <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />eceleni ou Kilistu, Muene ua Isaleli linga ashuluke ha cilindakano hano vene linga tumumone nakumutsiliela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Vaje vavamushukikile hamo nendi navakevo naua vamutengulukilile nakumushaula.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateu 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yiuano 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Omo litangua liakele hakati ka mutue, kuakele milima ha mavu oshe kutuala ha ntsimbu ya mucitatu ya mutania ua cinguezi. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ha ntsimbu ya mucitatu ya mutania ua cinguezi Yesu uasanene na lizi liakutambeka nguendi, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sambakatani?” Kulumbununa nguavo, “Njambi yange, Njambi yange, nkuma vika uanjisezela?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Kaha vamo vaje vakele nakuhita omo vevuile eci vahandekele nguavo, “Taleni, alinakusana Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Kaha umo uambuitikile mupelo mu viniu, naku haka ku lihongo na kumuhana linga anue, kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Vandameneni, tumone indi Eliya eja nakumushuluisa.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yesu uatambekele na lizi liakama, kaha uatsile.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Kaha ntanga ya mu njivo ya Njambi yatavukile hakati kuhuma kuilu nakuheta kuintsi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Omo mukuluntu ua masualale uje uemanene kuje oku natala Yesu, omo uamuene ngeci natsi kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Muavusunga ou yala uapuile Muna Njambi!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Kuje naua kuakele vampuevo vamo vaje vakele nakutalelela kulahako, hakati kavo hakele Maliya Mangandalena, na Maliya vaina ya Yakomba shongo ya Yosefa na Salome, <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />vaje vamo omo tele ali mu Ngalileya vamukavele nakumukuasa kaha naua na vampuevo vavengi vezile nendi ku Yelusalema.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamutsinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateu 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yiuano 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Omo cinguezi cahetele, naua liapuile litangua lia kulivuahesela, litangua lije ntsimbu kanda Sapalalo ihete, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosefa uaku Alamatiya, uje uavulemu cikuma ku mpunga, kaha naua uje uavandamenene kuija ca Vumuene vua Njambi, uasimpile nakuya kuli Pilato nakulomba muvila ua Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato ualikomokelele indi nga Yesu natsi laja, kaha uasanene mukuluntu ua masualale nakumuihula indi Yesu natsi laja. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Kaha omo uovuile kuli mukuluntu ua masualale nguendi natsi laja, uahanene muvila kuli Yosefa. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosefa ualandele ntanga ya liniu, nakuneha muvila ha mavu, kaha uamuzengelele muje mu ntanga ya liniu naku utsinda mu cihilo cije ca kucokola mu livue, kaha uasindumuinineko livue ku cikolo ca cihilo. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maliya Mangandalena na Maliya vaina ya Yosefa vamuene kuje ku vatsindile Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kusanguka ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mateu 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yiuano 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Omo Sapalalo yahitile, Maliya Mangandalena, na Maliya vaina ya Yakomba, na Salome, kaha valandele mazi a seho a luengo luacili linga vakavuavese muvila ua Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Omo capuile cimene mene ca litangua liakulivanga ha calumingu vayile ku cihilo omo litangua liatuhukile. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Kaha vahandekele kuli umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Nkuma iya honi akasa kukatuhumisila lije livue liakulema lije lili ku cikolo ca cihilo?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Vuno honi omo vatalele kulutue, vamuene lije livue liakama valihumisako. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Omo vakovelele mu cihilo, vamuene yala natumama ku cilio, nazala kazaku ka kutoka, kaha valikomokelele.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Keti muli komokele, mulina kutonda Yesu ua Nazaleta, uje ivashukikile. Nasanguka, uahimo mu cihela muva mutsindile. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Vuno honi yeni, mukaleke vandongisi vendi na Petulu ngueni alivanga kulutue lueni ku Ngalileya, kuje mu kamumona ngue muje muamilekele.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Kaha vahuminemo mu cihilo na liova, nakujaja nakulikomokela, kaha na cimo cahi civahandekele ku muntu uoshe, muomu vateuele.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alisholola kuli Maliya Mangandalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mateu 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yiuano 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Honi omo Yesu uasangukile ha litangua liakulivanga musondo, ha kulivanga ualisholuele kuli Maliya Mangandalena, uje yahumisile mahamba vatanu na vavali. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Kaha Maliya Mangandalena uayile nakuleka vaje vakele navo, vaje vakele na vusiua na kulila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Vuno honi omo vovuile nguavo ali nakuyoya kaha namumono, kuvamutsilielele.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alisholola kuli vandongisi vendi vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Hanima yeci Yesu ualisholuele mucifua ceka naua kuli vamo vantu vavali, vaje vakele nakuhuma mu nganda. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Kaha vahilukile nakuleka voshe, vuno honi kuvavatsilielele.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alisholola kuli vandongisi likumi naumo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateu 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yiuano 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Vilinga 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Hanima yevi Yesu ualisholuele kuli vandongisi vendi likumi na umo omo vatumanene ku mesa, kaha uavatenukilile muomu hakuhona lutsilielo na kukola ca mitima yavo, muomu kuvatsilielele vaje vamumuene tele nasanguka. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni mu cifuti coshe nakuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ku vantu voshe. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Uoshe uje atsiliela nakumumbuitika akovoka, vuno honi uje katsiliela vakamuhisa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Kaha vimueso vikakala na vaje vakatsiliela mu lizina liange, vakahumisa mahamba kaha vakahandeka na mu vindaka vieka, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />vakakuata manoka, kaha cipue vakanua cuma ca kutsiha ku cikavavulumuna, vakasaleka mavoko avo hali vaka kuvavala, kaha vaka kanguka.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamutuala muilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Vilinga 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Hanima yakuhandeka navo, Muene Yesu vamutualele muilu, nakutumama ku livoko lia cilio lia Njambi. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Vandongisi vayile nakuambulula kuoshe, kaha Muene uapangele navo nakushulisa mezi a vimueso vije vivalingile. Ameni.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>